事想跟你说')}。”`,\n};\nconst MET_TX = { 等: '她把菜往你那边推了推。“总算一起吃上了。”', 累: '她靠在你肩上，眼睛慢慢合上了。', 忙: '最后一片纸糊上了。她把灯举起来，对着你笑。', 想说: '她说了很久。你一直听着。' };\nconst OUT_TX = { 等: '另一副碗筷，到最后也没人动。', 累: '她撑着睡着了，灯没人添油。', 忙: '灯骨还散在桌上，她一个人糊到半夜。', 想说: '她张了张嘴，又低下头去。' };\n// 她說起往後兩天：一段需要的最後一晚\nconst FORE_TX = {\n  累: `“最近总${K('睡不好')}，这两天怕是${K('没什么精神')}。”`,\n  等: `“这两天灯坊活少，我${K('早点收工')}，${K('等你回来吃饭')}。”`,\n  忙: `“元宵的${K('灯单')}下来了，这两天得${K('赶工')}。”`,\n  想说: `“这两天${K('心里有些事')}，等你${K('得空')}，我想${K('跟你说说')}。”`,\n};\n// 台下的閒話：說的是她今晚\nconst CROWD_TX = {\n  累: `灯坊那家娘子，昨夜灯又亮到三更，${K('累')}得直不起腰。回去得有人${K('多照顾')}着。`,\n  等: `听说灯坊那家，饭桌上天天${K('多摆一副碗筷')}，就${K('等')}着人回去。`,\n  忙: `灯单压下来了，灯坊那家娘子${K('忙')}得脚不沾地，就缺个${K('搭把手')}的。`,\n  想说: `灯坊那家娘子今早在井边${K('欲言又止')}，像是${K('有话想说')}。`,\n};\nconst CROWD = {\n  open: ['开得正！', '头一句就稳。', '好嗓子，一开口就压住了。'],\n  hit: ['好！', '这一句接得严丝合缝。', '这口气续上了！', '有味儿！', '唱到点子上了。'],\n  big: ['连上了，连上了！', '这一串，满堂都静了。', '好——！'],\n  broke: ['这接的什么？', '乱了，乱了。', '倒了胃口。', '下去吧！'],\n  heavy: ['这彩画得重！', '满脸的彩，真够劲。'],\n  wild: ['锣鼓一催，什么都接得上。', '断了的气，又续上了！'],\n  clean: ['素着嗓子，倒更干净。', '不上妆也压得住台。'],\n  boost: ['这一托，把整串都托起来了！', '托得好，后面越唱越亮！'],\n  fin: ['压轴压得住！', '留到最后的，才是真本事。'],\n  seep: ['这脸，彩都要渗进肉里了。'],\n  blank: ['小凤的牌，到他手里也一样响。'],\n  perfect: ['满堂彩！', '这一场，值了！'],\n};\n// 同門的事：早上有人告訴你，台下也有人在聊\nconst EV_TX = {\n  tip: () => `玉楼路过灯坊，回来跟你说：阿檀今晚要${K(recipeShort(needOf(S)))}。`,\n  hot: () => `金宝昨晚唱了个${K('满堂彩')}，今天的水牌，他要往上蹿一大截。`,\n  grab: () => `月仙${K('抢了今天的压轴')}：你只剩四张的戏。`,\n  cheer: () => `魏老板请了一帮${K('捧场的')}：今天骰子 3 以上就算完美。`,\n  wei: () => `魏老板今天${K('亲自压轴')}，他的牌子要再高一截。`,\n  sick: () => `小凤${K('病倒了')}，嗓子哑着。魏老板把她的三张牌推到你面前：金很高，背面是空白。`,\n  back: () => `小凤${K('能下床了')}，魏老板把借你的牌收了回去。`,\n};\nconst EV_BUB = {\n  tip: `玉楼那张嘴，${K('灯坊')}的事他都知道。`,\n  hot: `金宝昨晚那出${K('满堂彩')}，我还在回味呢。`,\n  grab: `今儿${K('压轴怎么是月仙')}？`,\n  cheer: `魏老板请来的人，${K('嗓门可真大')}。`,\n  wei: `${K('魏老板亲自压轴')}，票都卖光了。`,\n  sick: `${K('小凤病了')}？今天的花旦换人了。`,\n  back: `${K('小凤回来了')}！还是她的嗓子亮。`,\n};\nconst lookIcon = look => LOOK_ICON[look] || '';\n// 情報的小籤\n// 情報小籤：預告的兩晚各要什麼\nfunction intelTag(fc0) {\n  return `<span class=\"itag\">情报 · ${fc0.nights.map(n => `第 ${n.d} 天 <b>${recipeShort(n)}</b>`).join('　｜　')}</span>`;\n}\n// 第二樣需要：她順口帶上的那一句、台下聽來的那一句\nconst ALSO_TX = { 等: `今晚想${K('早点一起吃饭')}。`, 累: `身上也${K('乏')}得很。`, 忙: `灯单也${K('还没赶完')}。`, 想说: `还${K('有件事想跟你说')}。` };\nconst CROWD_B = { 等: `那家的饭桌，${K('多摆了一副碗筷')}。`, 累: `那家娘子${K('累')}得直不起腰。`, 忙: `那家的${K('灯单赶不完')}。`, 想说: `那家娘子${K('有话想说')}。` };\nconst foreTx = f => FORE_TX[f.look] + f.nights.filter(n => n.items.length > 1).map(n => `“第 ${n.d} 天那晚，${ALSO_TX[n.items[1].look]}”`).join('') + (f.nights.some(n => n.k >= 3) ? `${K('那晚最要紧')}。` : '');\nconst ENDING_TX = {\n  满堂彩: '水牌最上面是你的名字。最后一场你没有上，台下还在叫你。你在家，灯亮着。',\n  压台: '你压住了全城的台。回到家，灯是她一个人点的，饭还热着。',\n  头牌: '你成了头牌。回到家，对面的椅子空着，灯上全是划痕。',\n  留白: '水牌上你不高不低。元宵夜你们一起点了灯，有几处没糊满，就那么留着。',\n  半台: '你唱了半台戏，也回了半个家。她还坐在对面，灯亮着一半。',\n  戏散: '戏散了，人也散了。你的名字还在水牌中间，没有人来问。',\n  卸尽: '你被摘了牌，脸上什么也没留下。她抬眼看你，把灯递到你手里。',\n  素脸: '摘牌那天，你素着脸回家。她没说什么，给你盛了饭。',\n  更夫: '春天，城里多了一个不上妆的更夫。你接过梆子，第一声敲在自家门口。',\n};\nconst USED_N = { stage: '演', home: '推', clean: '布' };\nconst RULES = [\n  '一副牌两面用：正面是台上面，背面是家里面。一张牌每天只能用一面。',\n  '早：挑 10 张进妆匣。木牌写着今天的起手族，匣里没有这一族就不能出发。第 3 天起可以去后台找孙师父：每天两张牌、一样物件（买一次整季都有用）。只有一种金：买东西花的就是卖座，水牌名次跟着掉，要靠往后多挣回来。',\n  '白天：最多 5 张。第一张打起手族（开得正 +1 金）。下一张打上一张写的那一族，就接上了：第 2 张多 1 金，第 3 张多 2，第 4 张起多 3。接错了连击从头算，已拿的金不扣；第 2 天起，接错一次记一点怨气，今晚多染一张。',\n  '每打一张，脸上多一层（重彩两层、素不上妆）；超过 4 层直接渗进底色。收场时连击到 3，掷一颗骰，4 以上金 ×1.5。后台的牌：百搭接谁都算接上，它后面打哪一族也都接得上，还能起手；压轴第 4 张起打出另加金；托接上时连击的金翻倍。',\n  '门口：她替你擦 2 层，不耗牌，但今晚她只听得下 1 张（痕到 3 她就不擦了）。自卸：每层弃 1 张牌。',\n  '傍晚：她今晚要的有四种花样：一张；两张同样的；两样各一张；三张（两张同样的加一张别的，第 9 天）。每一样都推够对路的牌（背面对上），这一晚才算满足；一段两晚都满足，她送你一张家常牌（对上算两张、灯 +3）。没推够：灯熄一截（灯 −3）。',\n  '最多推 3 张（被擦那晚 1 张）。没卸掉的层（每晚上限第一幕 1、第二幕 2、第三幕 3）加上怨气，决定前几张牌被染。对路的牌灯 +2，不对路的灯不涨；被染的牌灯上留一道痕，永久。',\n  '情报：一段需要的最后一晚，她会说起往后两晚各要什么；一上台，台下就有人聊她今晚的事；玉楼有时来递话。听到的都记在上面那一排。',\n  '夜：剩下的牌继续卸。没卸掉的层，每层变成 1 点底色。剩牌作废，明天全部回到卡组。',\n  '第二幕起：底色每 2 点妆匣少 1 位。第三幕：底色到 2，你演得最多的那一族，家里面被台上的字盖住，推出去就算被染；底色到 4 涉及两族。痕到 3，她的座位空了。',\n  '第 10 天元宵三选一：上台（金 ×2，不回家）、回家点灯（不演，只有这条路能到美满）、替小凤代演（金记在她名下）。',\n  '她会走：痕到 4，或灯熄了 5 回，吃完那顿饭她就走了，这一季当场结束。考核：第 3 天散戏后垫底、第 7 天散戏后排倒数两名，就摘牌，这一季也结束。结束后最后一次卸妆，然后看结局。',\n  '结局看结束那天的水牌名次和她：美满（灯糊满 30、一晚也没让她失望过（熄 0 回）、痕不超过 1、元宵回家点灯；提前摘牌时熄 0 回、痕不超过 1）、破裂（她走了）、守住（其余）。',\n];\nconst TIPS = [\n  '四族一圈：唱 → 念 → 做 → 打 → 唱。照牌上的「接」走，四张就能连成一串。',\n  '先看情报再装匣：她要几张、背面是什么，就带几张，台上别打掉（印着「家」的牌）。',\n  '10 张的账：四张上台 + 四张卸妆 + 两张推给她，刚好。打第 5 张、用重彩，就得想好拿哪几张去卸。',\n  '让她擦省两张牌，但今晚只听得下 1 张：要 2 张同样的晚上，得靠家常牌（一张算两张）；要两样、要三张的晚上别让她擦。',\n  '要三张的晚上：只打三张的链，多留一张回家。',\n  '后台买的东西要回本：第 3、4 天买，用得满七八天；第 8 天以后买，多半挣不回来。物件里琴师、锣鼓经天天都多拿金。',\n  '美满很难：每一晚的需要都得接住，还要多推几张对路的把灯糊满。台上就只能打四张，名次要靠买得准、接得好。',\n  '后台的牌：百搭救断链（前后都接得上），压轴放第 4 张，托放在链的后半，素省一张卸妆的牌，重彩金高但多一层。越早买，用的天数越多。',\n  '左上角记着灯、熄、痕：熄满 5 回或痕到 4 道，她就走。右上角的水牌写着下一次考核的底线。',\n  '同门的事早上就知道：月仙抢戏那天只有四张，魏老板请人捧场那天骰子 3 就算完美。',\n];\nconst ASSUME = [\n  '卡组：八种牌各 2 张，共 16 张。第 1、2 天的妆匣是装好的，第 3 天起自己挑。后台买的牌、她送的家常牌，永久进卡组。',\n  '第 1 天傍晚和夜自动结算：灯 +1，她说起第 2–3 天的事，剩下的层用剩下的牌卸。',\n  '她的需要四段（第 2–3、4–5、6–7、8–9 天）各有一个主要的样子，每局洗过。每晚的花样：第 2–3 天一张；第 4、8 天两张同样或两样各一；第 5、6 天还可能只要一张；第 7 天两张；第 9 天三张。元宵代演那晚是「等」，1 张。',\n  '后台每天两张牌（十二种：重彩慢板、踏转、起霸；百搭导板、数板、急急风；压轴韵白、卧鱼；素清唱、定场诗；托托腔、趟马，价钱 8–11）和一样物件（琴师、锣鼓经、护嗓茶、妆奁、熟手巾、灯油、小锣，价钱 9–16）。',\n  '她走了、被摘牌：都是当场结束，不再往下演；名次按结束那天的水牌算。第 10 天元宵那晚痕到 4 或灯熄满 5 回，照常走到结局（破裂）。',\n  '对手每天的金：魏老板约 20、金宝约 17、月仙约 14、玉楼约 7、小凤 9（第 4–7 天病着没有），每天上下浮动；金宝唱红那天 ×2，魏老板压轴那天 ×1.8。同分时对手在前。',\n  '同门的事：第 3 天玉楼递话、第 4 天小凤病倒、第 8 天小凤回来；第 5、6、7、9 天从「金宝唱红、月仙抢戏、魏老板捧场、魏老板压轴、玉楼递话」里挑。',\n  '痕 ≥3 座位空只在第三幕生效；座位空了那晚不能推牌，她的需要没人接，也不算灭灯，往后两天的事由更夫说。',\n  '元宵代演：演完照常回家。上台：演完直接到夜里。回家点灯：不演不推，灯点亮。',\n  '妆匣最少 6 位。灯纸 30 灯进度糊满（十五片，每片 2）。',\n];\nconst PENDING = [\n  '灭灯 −3、美满要灯 30、灯熄 5 回算破裂：都是自拟的，待试玩。',\n  '每晚花样的比例；第 9 天固定三张是否太难。',\n  '后台花卖座、美满要灯 30 和熄 0：模拟里照需要配匣又精打细算地买的打法，约两成拿第一、约一成满堂彩；见什么买什么的，几乎拿不到第一。',\n  '考核的底线（第 3 天垫底、第 7 天倒数两名）：模拟里会配匣的打法都过得了，只顾家不演的第 3 天就被摘牌。',\n];\n\n// ── 存檔：每次畫面更新都存一份，關掉再開可以接著玩 ──\nconst KEY = 'dise-v13';\nfunction save() { try { if (S) localStorage.setItem(KEY, JSON.stringify(S)); } catch (e) { /* 存不了就算了 */ } }\nfunction load() { try { const d = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY) || 'null'); return d && d.v === 13 ? d : null; } catch (e) { return null; } }\n\n// ── 聲音：戲院裡的幾聲，用合成的，不載檔案 ──\nlet audio = null, muted = false;\nfunction wakeAudio() { try { if (!audio) audio = new (window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext)(); if (audio.state === 'suspended') audio.resume(); } catch (e) { audio = null; } }\nfunction noise(dur, type, freq, gain) {\n  const n = audio.createBuffer(1, Math.floor(audio.sampleRate * dur), audio.sampleRate), d = n.getChannelData(0);\n  for (let i = 0; i < d.length; i++) d[i] = Math.random() * 2 - 1;\n  const s = audio.createBufferSource(), f = audio.createBiquadFilter(), g = audio.createGain(), t = audio.currentTime;\n  s.buffer = n; f.type = type; f.frequency.value = freq; f.Q.value = 0.8;\n  g.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, t); g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(gain, t + dur * 0.25); g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, t + dur);\n  s.connect(f); f.connect(g); g.connect(audio.destination); s.start();\n}\nconst MUSIC_KEY = 'dise-music';\nlet musicOn = (() => { try { return localStorage.getItem(MUSIC_KEY) !== '0'; } catch (e) { return true; } })();\nconst mus = { bus: null, kind: null, next: 0, step: 0, deg: 5 };\nconst PENTA = [0, 2, 4, 7, 9];\n// 五聲音階：宮商角徵羽；deg 每加 5 高一個八度\nconst hzOf = (deg, base) => base * Math.pow(2, (Math.floor(deg / 5) * 12 + PENTA[((deg % 5) + 5) % 5]) / 12);\nfunction musWant() {\n  if (!S || !musicOn || muted || !audio || document.hidden) return null;\n  if (view === 'stage' || view === 'morning') return 'stage';\n  if (['door', 'evening', 'night'].includes(view)) return 'home';\n  return null;\n}\n// 戲台：板、單皮鼓、小鑼，京胡拉一段五聲的旋律\nfunction stageBeat(t, i) {\n  const bus = mus.bus;\n  const tone = (type, f, g, dur, at = t) => { const o = audio.createOscillator(), e = audio.createGain(); o.type = type; o.frequency.setValueAtTime(f, at); e.gain.setValueAtTime(g, at); e.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, at + dur); o.connect(e); e.connect(bus); o.start(at); o.stop(at + dur + 0.02); };\n  if (i % 8 === 0) tone('triangle', 1650, 0.32, 0.06);\n  else if (i % 4 === 0) tone('triangle', 1650, 0.14, 0.05);\n  if ((i % 8 === 3 || i % 8 === 6 || i % 8 === 7) && Math.random() < 0.55) tone('square', 420, 0.05, 0.05);\n  if (i % 32 === 16) { tone('triangle', 1320, 0.07, 0.9); tone('triangle', 1985, 0.04, 0.6); }\n  // 京胡：鋸齒波過帶通，加一點揉弦\n  if (i % 16 >= 13) return;\n  if (i % 2 === 0 && Math.random() < 0.8) {\n    mus.deg = clamp(mus.deg + [-2, -1, -1, 1, 1, 2, 0][Math.floor(Math.random() * 7)], 3, 11);\n    const len = (Math.random() < 0.3 ? 4 : 2) * 0.3, o = audio.createOscillator(), v = audio.createOscillator(), vg = audio.createGain(), f = audio.createBiquadFilter(), e = audio.createGain();\n    o.type = 'sawtooth'; o.frequency.setValueAtTime(hzOf(mus.deg, 293.66), t);\n    v.frequency.value = 5.5; vg.gain.value = 5; v.connect(vg); vg.connect(o.frequency);\n    f.type = 'bandpass'; f.frequency.value = 1200; f.Q.value = 1.4;\n    e.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, t); e.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.06, t + 0.05); e.gain.setValueAtTime(0.05, t + len * 0.7); e.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, t + len);\n    o.connect(f); f.connect(e); e.connect(bus); o.start(t); v.start(t); o.stop(t + len + 0.05); v.stop(t + len + 0.05);\n  }\n}\n// 家裡：慢的撥弦（像古琴），偶爾一聲很低的長音\nfunction homeBeat(t, i) {\n  const bus = mus.bus;\n  if (Math.random() < 0.42 && i % 16 < 14) {\n    mus.deg = clamp(mus.deg + [-2, -1, 1, 2, 0][Math.floor(Math.random() * 5)], 2, 9);\n    const f0 = hzOf(mus.deg, 146.83), o = audio.createOscillator(), o2 = audio.createOscillator(), e = audio.createGain();\n    o.type = 'triangle'; o2.type = 'sine'; o.frequency.setValueAtTime(f0, t); o2.frequency.setValueAtTime(f0 * 2, t);\n    // 吟猱：有時尾音往下滑一點\n    if (Math.random() < 0.3) { o.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(f0 * 0.97, t + 1.6); o2.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(f0 * 1.94, t + 1.6); }\n    e.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, t); e.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.11, t + 0.008); e.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, t + 2.6);\n    o.connect(e); o2.connect(e); e.connect(bus); o.start(t); o2.start(t); o.stop(t + 2.7); o2.stop(t + 2.7);\n  }\n  if (i % 16 === 0) { const o = audio.createOscillator(), e = audio.createGain(); o.type = 'sine'; o.frequency.value = 73.42; e.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, t); e.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.05, t + 1.5); e.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, t + 7); o.connect(e); e.connect(bus); o.start(t); o.stop(t + 7.1); }\n}\nfunction musicTick() {\n  if (!audio) return;\n  try {\n    if (!mus.bus) { mus.bus = audio.createGain(); mus.bus.gain.value = 0; mus.bus.connect(audio.destination); }\n    const want = musWant(), t = audio.currentTime;\n    if (want !== mus.kind) {\n      mus.bus.gain.cancelScheduledValues(t); mus.bus.gain.setTargetAtTime(0, t, 0.35);\n      mus.kind = want; mus.next = t + 1.1; mus.step = 0; mus.deg = 5;\n      if (want) mus.bus.gain.setTargetAtTime(1, t + 1, 0.8);\n    }\n    if (!mus.kind) return;\n    while (mus.next < t + 0.35) { (mus.kind === 'stage' ? stageBeat : homeBeat)(mus.next, mus.step); mus.step += 1; mus.next += mus.kind === 'stage' ? 0.3 : 0.5; }\n  } catch (e) { /* 聲音出不來就算了 */ }\n}\nsetInterval(musicTick, 100);\nfunction sfx(k) {\n  if (!audio || muted) return;\n  try {\n    if (k === 'cheer') { noise(0.7, 'bandpass', 1500, 0.16); noise(0.45, 'bandpass', 900, 0.1); }\n    if (k === 'boo') noise(0.9, 'lowpass', 340, 0.2);\n    if (k === 'knock') [0, 0.42, 0.84].forEach(d => setTimeout(() => { if (!audio) return; const o = audio.createOscillator(), g = audio.createGain(), t = audio.currentTime; o.type = 'triangle'; o.frequency.setValueAtTime(760, t); o.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(320, t + 0.09); g.gain.setValueAtTime(0.28, t); g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, t + 0.14); o.connect(g); g.connect(audio.destination); o.start(); o.stop(t + 0.15); }, d * 1000));\n    if (k === 'cloth') noise(0.25, 'highpass', 2400, 0.05);\n    // 燈熄：一聲往下沉的低音；燈亮：一聲輕磬\n    if (k === 'out' || k === 'lit') { const o = audio.createOscillator(), g = audio.createGain(), t = audio.currentTime; o.type = k === 'out' ? 'sine' : 'triangle'; o.frequency.setValueAtTime(k === 'out' ? 260 : 880, t); o.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(k === 'out' ? 90 : 860, t + 0.9); g.gain.setValueAtTime(k === 'out' ? 0.22 : 0.12, t); g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, t + (k === 'out' ? 1.1 : 1.6)); o.connect(g); g.connect(audio.destination); o.start(); o.stop(t + 1.7); }\n  } catch (e) { /* 聲音出不來就算了 */ }\n}\n\n// 只有一個小籤（台上接上了、推牌的結果）\nfunction sayN(gain) { $('#sub').innerHTML = gain ? `<div class=\"sub n\"><span class=\"gain\">${esc(gain)}</span></div>` : ''; }\n// v1.6：同門、孫師父說話時，名字前面放一枚木刻頭像（沒有圖就只有名字）\nconst whoHTML = who => (who ? `${faceTag(who, 'sface')}<span class=\"who\">${esc(who)}</span><br>` : '');\nfunction say(who, tx, gain) {\n  $('#sub').innerHTML = tx ? `<div class=\"sub\">${whoHTML(who)}<span class=\"tx\">${esc(tx)}</span>${gain ? `<span class=\"gain\">${esc(gain)}</span>` : ''}</div>` : '';\n}\n// 帶高亮的字幕：需要、事件的詞會亮起來；gain 可以放情報小籤\nfunction sayH(who, html, gain) {\n  $('#sub').innerHTML = html ? `<div class=\"sub\">${whoHTML(who)}<span class=\"tx\">${html}</span>${gain ? `<span class=\"gain\">${gain}</span>` : ''}</div>` : '';\n}\nconst fc = f => `<i class=\"fc\" style=\"background:${FCOL[f]};${f === 'fight' ? 'color:#1c1719' : ''}\">${FAM[f].n}</i>`;\nfunction refresh() {\n  const on = view !== 'title';\n  $('#hud').hidden = !on; $('#title').hidden = on;\n  if (!on) { renderTitle(); $('#coach').hidden = true; hidePeek(); return; }\n  // 規矩、後台、水牌攤開時，字幕先收起來，紙用整個中間\n  document.querySelector('.talk').hidden = !!panel;\n  $('#hud').dataset.v = view;\n  const mb = $('#musicBtn'); mb.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(musicOn)); mb.textContent = musicOn ? '乐 开' : '乐 关'; mb.title = musicOn ? '背景音乐：开着（点一下关）' : '背景音乐：关着（点一下开）';\n  renderPlate(); renderBoardChip(); renderTop(); renderLeft(); renderMid(); renderChoices(); renderHand(); fitSpread(); peekSync(); renderSmear();\n  updateTable();\n  coachUpdate();\n  save();\n}\nfunction renderTitle() {\n  $('#title').innerHTML = `<div class=\"title-in\">\n    <div class=\"vb\"><div class=\"t\">底色</div><div class=\"s\">戏城 · 三幕</div></div>\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"intro\">你坐在戏班的桌前。十天，三幕。白天把牌排上戏台，傍晚把它翻过来，推给对面的阿檀。</p>\n      <p class=\"lede\">每打一张，脸上多一层油彩。没卸掉的油彩，会染上你推给她的牌，灯上就留一道痕。她每晚有一个需要，推不够，灯就熄一截。听台下的闲话、听她说往后几天的事，照着装匣。去后台买东西，花的就是卖座，名次会掉。灯熄满五回，她就走了；幕末考核垫底，牌子就被摘了——两样都会让这一季提前结束。</p>\n      <div class=\"form\">\n        <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"nm\">你的小名</label><input id=\"nm\" maxlength=\"6\" value=\"${esc(draftName)}\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n        <label class=\"tg\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"tutChk\" ${tutPref() ? 'checked' : ''}>带教学小框</label>\n        <button class=\"btn go\" data-act=\"start\">开锣</button>\n        ${saved ? `<button class=\"btn\" data-act=\"cont\">接着玩 · 第 ${saved.day} 天</button>` : ''}\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"hint\">${glOK ? '建议戴耳机、在大屏幕上玩。' : '这台设备显示不了 3D，卡牌和剧情照样能玩。'}约 55 分钟。所有数字都是占位，待试玩校准。</p>\n    </div></div>`;\n}\n// ── 詞條：教學、規矩裡的這些詞帶虛線，滑鼠停上去（手機點一下）就有說明 ──\nconst TERMS = {\n  卖座: '你唱戏挣的金。水牌按它排名；去后台买东西也花它，买了名次会掉。',\n  起手: '每天第一张必须打的那一族，写在木牌上。打对了叫「开得正」，多 1 金。',\n  接口: '每张牌写着「接 → 某一族」。下一张打那一族，就接上了，连击 +1。',\n  连击: '连着接上的张数。第 2 张起每张多拿金；接错了归零，已拿的金不扣。',\n  怨气: '第 2 天起，台上接错一次，台下就攒一点怨气。怨气会跟你回家，让你推给她的前几张牌被染。',\n  油彩: '台上每打一张牌，脸上多一层油彩（重彩两层、素不上妆），最多 4 层，再多就直接渗进底色。回家前要卸。',\n  底色: '没卸掉的油彩，睡一觉就渗进脸里，变成底色。底色只多不少：每 2 点，妆匣少一格；第三幕起，演得最多的那一族推给她时，会带着台上的字。',\n  被染: '脸上没卸掉的油彩和怨气，会染上你推给她的前几张牌（牌角有红）。推了被染的牌，灯上留一道痕。',\n  痕: '推了被染的牌，灯上划一道，永久。痕到 4 道，她就走了；美满要痕不超过 1。',\n  熄: '她当晚的需要没推够，灯熄一截（−3），记一回熄。熄满 5 回，她就走了；熄过一回，就到不了美满。',\n  灯: '阿檀糊的灯。推给她对路的牌 +2，家常牌 +3。糊满 30、一回没熄过、痕不超过 1、元宵回家点灯，才是美满。',\n  情报: '台下的闲话、她自己说的话里，藏着往后几晚她要什么。听到的记在上面那一排。',\n  考核: '第 3 天散戏后垫底、第 7 天散戏后排倒数两名，牌子就被摘了，这一季提前结束。',\n  百搭: '接在什么后面都算接上；它后面打哪一族也都接得上，还能起手。',\n  重彩: '金高，但脸上多一层油彩。',\n  压轴: '第 4 张起打出，另加金。',\n  素: '打出不上妆，脸上不添层。',\n  托: '接上时，这一张的连击金翻倍。',\n  家常牌: '她送你的牌，不上台。对上她的需要，一张算两张，灯 +3。',\n  完美: '收场时连击到 3，掷一颗骰，4 以上，这一场的金 ×1.5。',\n  让她擦: '卸妆的一种：她替你擦，一次 2 层、不耗牌；但这一晚她只听得下 1 张。',\n};\n// 自動加虛線的只取這幾個（單字的牌名關鍵詞不自動加，免得「素着脸」也冒虛線）\nconst AUTO_TERMS = ['卖座', '起手', '接口', '连击', '怨气', '油彩', '底色', '被染', '痕', '熄', '情报', '考核', '家常牌', '完美', '让她擦'];\nconst TERM_RE = new RegExp(AUTO_TERMS.sort((a, b) => b.length - a.length).join('|'), 'g');\n// 把一段 HTML 裡第一次出現的詞條包起來（標籤裡面的不動）\nfunction termify(html) {\n  const done = new Set();\n  return html.split(/(<[^>]+>)/).map((seg, i, all) => {\n    if (seg.startsWith('<') || (i > 0 && /class=\"term\"/.test(all[i - 1]))) return seg;\n    return seg.replace(TERM_RE, w => (done.has(w) ? w : (done.add(w), `<i class=\"term\" data-term=\"${w}\" tabindex=\"0\">${w}</i>`)));\n  }).join('');\n}\nconst tipEl = () => $('#tip');\nfunction showTip(el) {\n  const k = el.dataset.term, raw = k ? [k, TERMS[k]] : (el.dataset.tip || '').split('|');\n  if (!raw[1]) return;\n  const t = tipEl();\n  t.innerHTML = `<b>${esc(raw[0])}</b>${esc(raw[1])}`;\n  t.hidden = false;\n  const r = el.getBoundingClientRect(), w = t.offsetWidth, h = t.offsetHeight;\n  const below = r.bottom + h + 10 < innerHeight;\n  t.style.left = `${clamp((r.left + r.right) / 2 - w / 2, 8, innerWidth - w - 8)}px`;\n  t.style.top = `${below ? r.bottom + 8 : r.top - h - 8}px`;\n}\nconst hideTip = () => { tipEl().hidden = true; };\ndocument.addEventListener('pointerover', e => { const el = e.target.closest('[data-term],[data-tip]'); if (el) showTip(el); else hideTip(); });\ndocument.addEventListener('focusin', e => { const el = e.target.closest('[data-term],[data-tip]'); if (el) showTip(el); else hideTip(); });\ndocument.addEventListener('pointerdown', e => { if (e.pointerType !== 'mouse') { const el = e.target.closest('[data-term],[data-tip]'); if (el) showTip(el); else hideTip(); } });\n// 熄過幾回、痕幾道：到了上限，她就走了\nconst outsHTML = (fresh = false) => `<span class=\"outs\">${Array.from({ length: R.brokenOuts }, (_, i) => `<i class=\"${i < S.outs ? 'on' : ''} ${fresh && i === S.outs - 1 ? 'new' : ''}\"></i>`).join('')}</span>`;\nconst scarsHTML = () => `<span class=\"scars\">${Array.from({ length: R.brokenScar }, (_, i) => `<i class=\"${i < S.scars ? 'on' : ''}\"></i>`).join('')}</span>`;\nfunction renderPlate() {\n  const st = starterOf(S);\n  const stOn = st && ['morning', 'stage'].includes(view);\n  $('#plate').innerHTML = `<div class=\"d\">第 ${S.day} 天</div>\n    <div class=\"st\" ${stOn ? '' : 'hidden'}>起手 ${stOn ? fc(st) : ''}</div><div class=\"g\"><i class=\"term\" data-term=\"卖座\">卖座</i><b>${S.gold}</b></div>`;\n  // 左欄跟在木牌底下\n  const lc = $('#leftcol'); lc.style.top = innerWidth > 760 ? `${Math.round($('#plate').getBoundingClientRect().bottom + 8)}px` : '';\n}\n// 考核的底線怎麼說\nconst examTx = ne => (ne.fail === R.ranks ? '别垫底' : `别进倒数${['', '两', '三', '四'][R.ranks - ne.fail] || ''}名`);\n// 右上的水牌小牌：名次，和上一名差多少；下一次考核\nfunction renderBoardChip() {\n  const el = $('#wboard');\n  if (['board', 'lastwipe', 'reveal', 'watch'].includes(view) || !uiOn.board()) { el.innerHTML = ''; return; }\n  const b = boardOf(S), i = b.findIndex(r => r.me), up = b[i - 1], dn = b[i + 1];\n  const gap = boardDay(S) < 1 ? '还没开锣' : up ? `差${esc(up.n)} ${up.g - S.gold + 1}` : dn ? `领先${esc(dn.n)} ${S.gold - dn.g}` : '';\n  const ne = nextExam(S), bad = ne && i + 1 >= ne.fail && boardDay(S) >= 1;\n  const ex = ne && (bad || ne.day - S.day <= 1) ? `<span class=\"exam ${bad ? 'bad' : ''}\">${ne.day === S.day ? '今天' : '明天'}散戏后<i class=\"term\" data-term=\"考核\">考核</i>：${examTx(ne)}</span>` : '';\n  // 主畫面直接看三行：上一名、你、下一名（第一就看下兩名，墊底就看上兩名）\n  const from = clamp(i - 1, 0, b.length - 3), rows = b.slice(from, from + 3).map((r, k) => `<li class=\"${r.me ? 'me' : ''} ${ne && from + k + 1 === ne.fail ? 'fail' : ''}\"><span><span class=\"n\">${from + k + 1}</span>${r.me ? '你' : esc(r.n)}</span><span>${r.g}</span></li>`).join('');\n  const fresh = !(S.ui && S.ui.board);\n  if (!S.ui) S.ui = {};\n  S.ui.board = true;\n  el.innerHTML = `<button class=\"wb ${fresh ? 'popin' : ''}\" data-act=\"water\" aria-label=\"水牌第 ${i + 1}，${gap}${ne ? `，第 ${ne.day} 天考核${examTx(ne)}` : ''}。点开看全部\"><span class=\"wbh\"><span>水牌</span><span>第 <b>${i + 1}</b> / ${b.length}</span></span><ol>${rows}</ol><span class=\"dif\">${gap}</span>${ex}</button>${S.relics.length ? `<div class=\"relics\" aria-label=\"物件\">${S.relics.map(r => `<button class=\"rel\" data-tip=\"${esc(RELICS[r].n)}|${esc(RELICS[r].tx)}\" aria-label=\"${esc(RELICS[r].n)}：${esc(RELICS[r].tx)}\">${relicTag(r, 'ri', 44, '#f2d48a', '#f4ecdc')}${RELICS[r].n}</button>`).join('')}</div>` : ''}`;\n}\n// v1.6：物件圖示（<img>）；沒有圖就是空字串\nconst relicTag = (k, cls, size, line, acc) => { const u = relicIcon(k, size, line, acc); return u ? `<img class=\"${cls}\" src=\"${u}\" alt=\"\">` : ''; };\n// 情報：聽來的需要，按段排；今晚的那一條亮著\nfunction intelHTML(onlyNow = false) {\n  if (seatEmpty(S)) return '';\n  const items = [];\n  // 今晚的需要已經過了（夜裡、吃完飯），就從明天記起\n  for (let d = view === 'night' || S.T.judged ? S.day + 1 : S.day; d < (onlyNow ? S.day + 1 : R.days); d++) if (S.known[d]) items.push({ d, nd: needOf(S, d) });\n  if (!items.length) return '';\n  const lab = d => (d === S.day ? '今晚' : d === S.day + 1 ? '明晚' : `第${d}天`);\n  return `<div class=\"intel\" role=\"note\" aria-label=\"情报\"><span class=\"lbl\">情报</span>${items.map(it => `<span class=\"ic ${it.d === S.day ? 'now' : ''}\"><span class=\"d\">${lab(it.d)}</span>${it.nd.items.map(x => `${lookIcon(x.look)}${x.look} → <b>${HOME[LOOK_HOME[x.look]].n}</b>×${x.n}`).join(' + ')}</span>`).join('')}</div>`;\n}\n// 這一種牌的背面是她今晚要的（早上攤開的牌用）\nconst needKind = k => !!S.known[S.day] && !seatEmpty(S) && S.choice !== 'stage' && S.choice !== 'lamp' && !T[k].blank && needOf(S).items.some(x => x.look === (T[k].home ? HOME[FAM[T[k].f].home].look : HOME[FAM[T[k].f].home].look));\n// 這張牌的背面是她今晚要的：台上留著、卸妝別弃\nconst keepHint = id => !!S.known[S.day] && !seatEmpty(S) && S.choice !== 'stage' && S.choice !== 'lamp' && !tOf(S, id).blank && needOf(S).items.some(x => x.look === lookOfCard(S, id));\nconst gotOf = t => t.need.items.reduce((a, x) => a + Math.min(x.n, t.got[x.look] || 0), 0);\nfunction renderTop() {\n  const m = $('#topmid'), t = S.T;\n  if (view === 'stage') {\n    const parts = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < t.stageMax; i++) {\n      const p = t.plays[i];\n      if (i) parts.push(`<span class=\"lk ${p && p.broke ? 'x' : ''}\">${p ? (p.broke ? '✕' : '▸') : ''}</span>`);\n      parts.push(p ? `<div class=\"pl\" style=\"background:${FCOL[p.f]};${p.f === 'fight' ? 'color:#1c1719' : ''}\">${tOf(S, p.id).n}<small>+${p.g + p.extra + p.open + p.fin}</small></div>` : '<div class=\"pl no\"></div>');\n    }\n    const last = t.plays[t.plays.length - 1], nx = nextFam(S);\n    let line;\n    if (t.ended) line = `这一场 <b>${t.gold}</b> 金${t.perfect ? ' · 完美' : ''}`;\n    else if (!last) line = `起手打 ${fc(nx)}`;\n    else if (t.plays.length >= t.stageMax) line = `${t.stageMax === R.stageMax ? '五' : '四'}张打满了`;\n    else if (last.broke) line = `<span class=\"bad\">断了</span> 下一张接 ${nx === '*' ? '任意' : fc(nx)}`;\n    else if (nx === '*') line = `下一张接 <b>任意</b> <small>+${nextBonus(S)} 金</small>`;\n    else line = `下一张接 <i class=\"fc nx\" style=\"background:${FCOL[nx]};${nx === 'fight' ? 'color:#1c1719' : ''}\">${FAM[nx].n}</i> <small>${t.chain > 1 ? `连击 ×${t.chain} · ` : ''}+${nextBonus(S)} 金</small>`;\n    if (t.grudge && !t.ended) line += ` <small class=\"bad\">怨气 ${t.grudge}</small>`;\n    m.innerHTML = `<div class=\"chain\" id=\"chain\"><div class=\"played\">${parts.join('')}</div><div class=\"nowline\">${line}</div></div>${intelHTML(true)}`;\n    return;\n  }\n  if (view === 'evening' && lookNow(S) && S.choice !== 'lamp') {\n    const nd = t.need, look = lookNow(S), got = gotOf(t), done = got >= nd.k;\n    const rows = nd.items.map(x => { const g = Math.min(x.n, t.got[x.look] || 0); return `<div class=\"nr ${g >= x.n ? 'ok' : ''}\">${LOOK_ICON[x.look]}<span><i class=\"lkn\">她${x.look} → 要 </i><b class=\"hn\">${HOME[LOOK_HOME[x.look]].n}</b></span><span class=\"pips\">${Array.from({ length: x.n }, (_, i) => `<i class=\"${i < g ? 'on' : ''}\"></i>`).join('')}</span></div>`; }).join('');\n    m.innerHTML = `<div class=\"need ${done ? 'done' : ''}\" role=\"status\"><button class=\"lookb\" data-act=\"look\" aria-expanded=\"${lookOpen}\" aria-label=\"她今晚的样子：${look}\">${LOOK_ICON[look]}<span class=\"lb\">${look}</span></button>\n      <div class=\"nt\">${rows}<small>${done ? '都够了。再推对路的，灯 +2' : `还差 ${nd.k - got} 张${nd.items.length > 1 ? '，每一样都要够' : ''}`}</small></div></div>`;\n    return;\n  }\n  // 早上、門口、夜裡：一條金字說這一步要做什麼\n  const n = t.layers.length;\n  let goal = '';\n  if (view === 'morning' && !lockedBox(S) && S.choice !== 'lamp') goal = `装妆匣 <b>${t.box.length}</b>/${t.cap}${starterOf(S) ? ` <small>起手 ${FAM[starterOf(S)].n} 要带</small>` : ''}`;\n  else if (view === 'morning') goal = '妆匣装好了 <small>出门</small>';\n  else if (view === 'door') goal = n ? `进门前卸妆 <b>${n}</b> 层 <small>没卸的会染牌</small>` : '脸是干净的 <small>进门</small>';\n  else if (view === 'night') goal = n ? `睡前还有 <b>${n}</b> 层 <small>过夜就渗进底色</small>` : '夜深了 <small>睡吧</small>';\n  m.innerHTML = `${goal ? `<div class=\"goal\">${goal}</div>` : ''}${['morning', 'night'].includes(view) ? intelHTML() : ''}`;\n}\n// ── 介面分批出現：第 1 天台上只有木牌、連擊、手牌；第一次回家才有「家」；第 2 天早上才有水牌和圖鑑 ──\nconst uiOn = {\n  board: () => S.day >= 2,\n  home: () => S.day >= 2 || ['door', 'evening', 'night'].includes(view),\n  book: () => S.day >= 2,\n};\n// 第一次出現的那一下，彈一下引人看\nfunction uiReveal(el, k) {\n  if (!S.ui) S.ui = {};\n  if (S.ui[k]) return;\n  S.ui[k] = true;\n  el.classList.remove('popin'); void el.offsetWidth; el.classList.add('popin');\n}\n// 左欄：家（燈、熄、痕，她會不會走），和圖鑑\nfunction renderLeft() {\n  const el = $('#leftcol'), hp = $('#homep');\n  el.hidden = ['board', 'lastwipe', 'reveal', 'watch'].includes(view) || !uiOn.home();\n  if (el.hidden) return;\n  uiReveal(hp, 'home');\n  $('#bookBtn').hidden = !uiOn.book();\n  if (uiOn.book()) uiReveal($('#bookBtn'), 'book');\n  const danger = S.outs >= R.brokenOuts - 2 || S.scars >= R.brokenScar - 1;\n  hp.className = `homep ${danger ? 'warn' : ''}`;\n  hp.innerHTML = `<div class=\"hh\"><span>家 · 阿檀</span><span>${S.left ? '她走了' : seatEmpty(S) ? '座位空了' : ''}</span></div>\n    <div class=\"hl\" data-term=\"灯\">${lampSVG(S.lamp)}<div><b>${S.lamp}</b><small>/${R.lampFull}</small></div></div>\n    <div class=\"hrow ${S.outs >= R.brokenOuts - 2 ? 'hot' : ''}\" data-term=\"熄\"><span class=\"k\">熄</span>${outsHTML()}${S.outs >= R.brokenOuts - 2 ? `<em>再 ${R.brokenOuts - S.outs} 回她走</em>` : ''}</div>\n    <div class=\"hrow ${S.scars >= R.brokenScar - 1 ? 'hot' : ''}\" data-term=\"痕\"><span class=\"k\">痕</span>${scarsHTML()}${S.scars >= R.brokenScar - 1 ? `<em>再 ${R.brokenScar - S.scars} 道她走</em>` : ''}</div>`;\n  hp.setAttribute('aria-label', `家：灯 ${S.lamp}，熄过 ${S.outs} 回，痕 ${S.scars} 道；熄满 ${R.brokenOuts} 回或痕到 ${R.brokenScar} 道，她就走`);\n  if (innerWidth <= 760) el.style.top = `${Math.round(Math.max($('#plate').getBoundingClientRect().bottom, $('#topmid').getBoundingClientRect().bottom) + 6)}px`;\n  const seen = new Set(S.deck.map(c => c.t)).size;\n  $('#bookBtn').innerHTML = `图鉴<small>牌 ${seen}/${BOOK_CARDS.length}</small>`;\n}\n// ── 圖鑑：每張牌、每樣物件、每個詞；順便講一點戲 ──\nconst BOOK_CARDS = [...BASIC, ...BORROWED, ...SHOP, ...GIFTS];\nconst LORE = {\n  changqiang: '唱腔里拖得很长的一句，一个字能绕好几道弯，最见演员的气口和韵味。',\n  liangsang: '一开口就把嗓子亮出来，又高又脆。老戏迷讲究「先声夺人」，头一句就定了角儿的分量。',\n  bai: '念白，「唱念做打」里的「念」。京剧念白分韵白和京白；行里有句老话：「千斤话白四两唱」，念比唱还难。',\n  kuaiban: '京剧的快板是有板无眼、节奏很快的唱腔板式；曲艺里也有打着竹板说唱的快板。这里取它一气呵成的急劲。',\n  shenduan: '演员在台上的形体动作，统称身段。手、眼、身、法、步，都在里面。',\n  shuixiu: '戏服袖口接出的一段白绸。抖、甩、掸、挑、翻，一条袖子能演出喜怒哀乐。',\n  liangxiang: '一段动作结束时猛地停住，摆出一个定型的姿势，把人物的精神「亮」给观众看。',\n  fanshen: '身体在竖直的平面上翻转的身段，武生、刀马旦常用；连着翻，叫「串翻身」。',\n  jie_kutou: '唱腔里表现悲痛的哭腔，常接在唱句后面，一声「喂呀」。',\n  jie_guankou: '一口气连贯念出的大段词，字字清楚，像不换气似的往外送。相声里最常见，戏曲念白也讲究这股劲。',\n  jie_dadao: '武戏里的大刀，比如关羽的青龙偃月刀。耍大刀讲究刀花、背刀和下场的架势。',\n  manban: '京剧板式里最慢的一种，一板三眼，字少腔多，最适合抒情。',\n  tazhuan: '游戏里把「踏步」和「转身」这两样常见的步法身段合在一起，起了这个名字。',\n  qiba: '武将出征前整盔、束甲的一套程式动作，表现大将的英武。相传源自明代传奇《千金记》里霸王起兵的一场。',\n  daoban: '京剧板式，常用在成套唱腔的开头：演员往往先在幕内唱一句导板，再走出来。',\n  shuban: '合着板眼一句一句数下去的念诵，多由丑角来，诙谐利落。',\n  jijifeng: '一种锣鼓点子，节奏急促密集，多用在武将上下场、开打和紧张的场面。',\n  yunbai: '京剧念白的一种，用湖广音、中州韵，抑扬顿挫像在吟诵，多给正派人物用。',\n  woyu: '旦角身段：身子盘旋着卧下、往后仰。《贵妃醉酒》里杨玉环俯身闻花的卧鱼最有名。',\n  qingchang: '不化妆、不穿戏服、不做身段，只唱。票友聚在一起，常这样唱。',\n  dingchang: '角色第一次上场时念的四句诗，交代身份和心境；念完，场子就「定」住了。',\n  tuoqiang: '琴师用京胡跟着演员的唱腔走，托住、垫住，叫「托腔保调」。好琴师能让角儿唱得更舒服。',\n  tangma: '表现骑马赶路的一套程式动作。手里一根马鞭，就是一匹马。',\n  tang: '不是戏。她把汤热了第二回，等你回来。',\n  fan: '不是戏。两只碗、两双筷子，她摆好了。',\n  xin: '不是戏。她把你早年写的信翻出来，用红线又扎了一遍。',\n  zhi: '不是戏。灯糊完了，她剪了一朵花，贴在窗上。',\n};\nconst RELIC_LORE = {\n  qinshi: '京剧乐队里拉京胡的人，是角儿的「另一条嗓子」。',\n  gujing: '锣鼓点子的口诀，用「仓、才、台、七」这样的字念出来，记熟了才打得齐。',\n  cha: '唱戏的人护嗓子，常泡一杯胖大海或罗汉果。',\n  lian: '放胭脂、粉和首饰的小匣子。',\n  jin: '用旧了、用软了的手巾，卸妆不伤脸。',\n  you: '点灯用的油。',\n  luo: '乐队里的小锣，声音清脆，常给旦角、文戏打点子。',\n};\nlet bookTab = 'cards', bookSel = null;\nfunction bookPanel() {\n  const owned = new Set(S.deck.map(c => c.t));\n  const tabs = [['cards', '牌'], ['relics', '物件'], ['terms', '词条']].map(([k, n]) => `<button class=\"btn small ${bookTab === k ? 'go' : ''}\" data-act=\"booktab\" data-arg=\"${k}\" aria-pressed=\"${bookTab === k}\">${n}</button>`).join('');\n  let body = '';\n  if (bookTab === 'cards') {\n    if (bookSel) {\n      const k = bookSel, tp = T[k], kind = tp.home ? '家常牌（她送的）' : BASIC.includes(k) ? '基础牌' : BORROWED.includes(k) ? '借来的牌' : `后台的牌 · ${T[k].price} 金`;\n      const lines = tp.home ? ['不上台。', `对上她的需要，一张算两张，灯 +3。`] : stageLines(k);\n      body = `<div class=\"bookd\"><div class=\"faces\"><figure><img src=\"${cardArt(k, 'stage').url}\" alt=\"\">台上面</figure>${tp.home ? '' : `<figure><img src=\"${cardArt(k, 'home').url}\" alt=\"\">家里面</figure>`}</div>\n        <div class=\"bt\"><h3>${tp.n}<small>${tp.home ? '' : FAM[tp.f].n + ' · '}${kind}${owned.has(k) ? '' : ' · 还没拿到'}</small></h3>\n        <h4>怎么用</h4><p>${lines.map(esc).join('<br>')}${tp.home ? '' : `<br>背面：${tp.blank ? '空白（借来的牌，推给她灯不涨）' : `${HOME[FAM[tp.f].home].n}（她「${HOME[FAM[tp.f].home].look}」时要的）`}`}</p>\n        <h4>${tp.home ? '这张牌' : '戏里的讲究'}</h4><p>${esc(LORE[k] || '')}</p>\n        <button class=\"btn small\" data-act=\"booksel\" data-arg=\"\">回到全部</button></div></div>`;\n    } else {\n      const grp = (title, ks) => `<h4>${title}</h4><div class=\"bookg\">${ks.map(k => `<button class=\"bc ${owned.has(k) ? '' : 'un'}\" data-act=\"booksel\" data-arg=\"${k}\" aria-label=\"${T[k].n}${owned.has(k) ? '' : '，还没拿到'}\"><img src=\"${cardArt(k, 'stage').url}\" alt=\"\"><span>${T[k].n}</span></button>`).join('')}</div>`;\n      body = `<p class=\"note\">点一张看它怎么用、戏里有什么讲究。暗着的是还没拿到的。</p>${grp('基础牌', BASIC)}${grp('借来的牌', BORROWED)}${grp('后台的牌', SHOP)}${grp('家常牌（她送的）', GIFTS)}`;\n    }\n  } else if (bookTab === 'relics') {\n    body = `<ul class=\"bookr\">${RELIC_KEYS.map(k => `<li class=\"${S.relics.includes(k) ? 'own' : ''}\">${relicTag(k, 'bri', 112)}<b>${RELICS[k].n}</b><small>${RELICS[k].price} 金${S.relics.includes(k) ? ' · 已有' : ''}</small><p>${esc(RELICS[k].tx)}</p><p class=\"lore\">${esc(RELIC_LORE[k])}</p></li>`).join('')}</ul>`;\n  } else {\n    body = `<dl class=\"bookt\">${Object.entries(TERMS).map(([k, v]) => `<dt>${k}</dt><dd>${esc(v)}</dd>`).join('')}</dl>`;\n  }\n  return `<div class=\"panel tujian\"><h2>图鉴<button class=\"btn small\" style=\"float:right\" data-act=\"close\">关上</button></h2><div class=\"tabs\">${tabs}</div>${body}</div>`;\n}\nfunction midHTML() {\n  if (panel === 'book') return bookPanel();\n  if (panel === 'rules') return rulesPanel();\n  if (panel === 'shop') return shopPanel();\n  if (panel === 'water') return waterPanel();\n  if (sheet) return sheetPanel();\n  if (view === 'morning') return morningPanel();\n  return '';\n}\n// 每次點擊都會重畫；同一張紙要留住捲動位置和焦點，不然一按就跳回最上面\nfunction renderMid() {\n  const m = $('#mid'), key = `${view}|${panel}|${sheet ? sheet.k : ''}`, old = m.querySelector('.panel, .spread');\n  const top = old && m.dataset.key === key ? old.scrollTop : 0;\n  const fe = document.activeElement, fa = fe && m.contains(fe) && fe.dataset.act ? [fe.dataset.act, fe.dataset.arg] : null;\n  m.innerHTML = midHTML();\n  m.dataset.key = key;\n  const nu = m.querySelector('.panel, .spread');\n  if (nu) nu.scrollTop = top;\n  if (fa) {\n    const b = m.querySelector(`[data-act=\"${fa[0]}\"]${fa[1] !== undefined ? `[data-arg=\"${CSS.escape(fa[1])}\"]` : ''}`);\n    if (b && !b.disabled) b.focus({ preventScroll: true });\n  }\n}\nfunction morningPanel() {\n  const t = S.T;\n  if (S.day === R.days && !S.choice) {\n    return `<div class=\"yuan\"><h3>元宵，三选一</h3><div class=\"pair\">\n      <button class=\"yn\" data-act=\"yuan\" data-arg=\"stage\">上台<small>起手打 · 金 ×2 · 不回家，灯由她一个人点</small></button>\n      <button class=\"yn\" data-act=\"yuan\" data-arg=\"lamp\">回家点灯<small>不演 · 灯点亮 · 只有这条路能到美满</small></button>\n      <button class=\"yn\" data-act=\"yuan\" data-arg=\"cover\">替小凤代演<small>起手唱 · 金记在她名下，她留在水牌上</small></button>\n    </div></div>`;\n  }\n  if (lockedBox(S) || S.choice === 'lamp') return '';\n  const kinds = [...BASIC, ...BORROWED, ...SHOP, ...GIFTS].filter(k => S.deck.some(c => c.t === k));\n  const cells = kinds.map(k => {\n    const free = S.deck.filter(c => c.t === k && !t.box.includes(c.id)), can = free.length > 0;\n    const nk = needKind(k);\n    return `<button class=\"spc ${nk && can ? 'want' : ''}\" data-act=\"pick\" data-arg=\"${k}\" data-t=\"${k}\" ${can ? '' : 'disabled'} aria-label=\"${T[k].n}，还有 ${free.length} 张${nk ? '，背面是她今晚要的' : ''}\"><img src=\"${cardArt(k, 'stage').url}\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"ct\">${free.length}</span>${nk && can ? '<span class=\"wtag\" aria-hidden=\"true\">家</span>' : ''}</button>`;\n  }).join('');\n  const shop = t.offers.length ? `<button class=\"mini\" data-act=\"shop\" style=\"border-color:#f2d48a;color:#f2d48a\">后台 · 孙师父（花卖座，名次会掉）</button>` : '';\n  return `<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sph\">卡组 · 点一张放进妆匣</div>${cells}${shop ? `<div class=\"tools2\">${shop}</div>` : ''}</div>`;\n}\n// 攤開的牌照桌上的空位排：在這塊空位裡把牌放到最大，放不下一列就折行\nfunction fitSpread() {\n  const sp = $('#mid .spread');\n  if (!sp) return;\n  const n = sp.querySelectorAll('.spc').length, mid = $('#mid').getBoundingClientRect(), cs = getComputedStyle(sp);\n  const padX = parseFloat(cs.paddingLeft) + parseFloat(cs.paddingRight), padY = parseFloat(cs.paddingTop) + parseFloat(cs.paddingBottom);\n  const gx = parseFloat(cs.columnGap) || 10, gy = parseFloat(cs.rowGap) || 8, tools = (sp.querySelector('.tools2')?.offsetHeight || 32) + gy + (sp.querySelector('.sph')?.offsetHeight || 0) + gy;\n  // 可用的空位：寬螢幕夾在左邊木牌、妝匣和右邊水牌之間，從情報底下開始；窄螢幕在木牌底下、整個寬度\n  const R = el => (el && !el.hidden && el.getClientRects().length ? el.getBoundingClientRect() : null);\n  const plate = R($('#plate')), tray = R($('#leftcol')), side = R(document.querySelector('.side')), tm = R($('#topmid'));\n  const wide = innerWidth >= 760;\n  let topY, gut;\n  if (wide) {\n    gut = Math.max(plate ? plate.right : 0, tray && tray.top < mid.bottom ? tray.right : 0, side ? innerWidth - side.left : 0) + 12;\n    topY = (tm && tm.height > 4 ? tm.bottom : plate ? plate.top : mid.top) + 8;\n  } else {\n    gut = 8;\n    topY = Math.max(plate ? plate.bottom : 0, side ? side.bottom : 0, tm ? tm.bottom : 0) + 8;\n  }\n  topY = Math.min(topY, mid.top);\n  const W = innerWidth - 2 * gut - padX - 2, H = mid.bottom - topY - padY - tools - 6;\n  let best = { h: 0, cols: 4, rows: 99 };\n  for (let cols = 1; cols <= n; cols++) {\n    const rows = Math.ceil(n / cols);\n    const h = Math.min(210, (H - (rows - 1) * gy) / rows, (W - (cols - 1) * gx) / cols * 1.5);\n    // 牌已經到最大了，就排成行數少的；行數一樣，取每行少的（排得勻）\n    if (h > best.h + 0.5 || (h >= 209.5 && best.h >= 209.5 && rows < best.rows)) best = { h, cols, rows };\n  }\n  const h = Math.max(84, Math.floor(best.h));\n  sp.style.top = `${topY - mid.top}px`;\n  sp.style.maxHeight = `${mid.bottom - topY}px`;\n  sp.style.setProperty('--cols', best.cols);\n  sp.style.setProperty('--chh', `${h}px`);\n  sp.style.setProperty('--cw', `${Math.round(h / 1.5)}px`);\n}\naddEventListener('resize', () => { if (view === 'morning') fitSpread(); });\n// 試排：用卡組裡這些牌，今天起手打四張，最好的一條鏈能拿多少金（不算擲骰）\nfunction bestLineGold(types, n = 4) {\n  const start = starterOf(S);\n  if (!start) return 0;\n  const cnt = {}; types.forEach(t => { cnt[t] = (cnt[t] || 0) + 1; });\n  let best = 0;\n  const walk = (k, want, g) => {\n    if (k === n) { best = Math.max(best, g); return; }\n    for (const t of Object.keys(cnt)) {\n      const tp = T[t];\n      if (!cnt[t] || tp.home || (k === 0 ? !(tp.f === want || tp.wild) : !(tp.wild || want === '*' || tp.f === want))) continue;\n      const add = tp.g + (k === 0 ? R.openGold + (has(S, 'gujing') ? 3 : 0) : (R.chainGold[Math.min(k + 1, R.stageMax)] + (has(S, 'qinshi') ? 1 : 0)) * (tp.boost ? 2 : 1)) + (tp.fin && k >= 3 ? tp.fin : 0);\n      cnt[t] -= 1; walk(k + 1, tp.wild ? '*' : tp.next, g + add); cnt[t] += 1;\n    }\n    best = Math.max(best, g);\n  };\n  walk(0, start, 0);\n  return best;\n}\n// 還剩幾場戲（今天這場也算）\nconst daysLeft = () => R.days - S.day + 1;\n// 幾天回本：每天多拿 d 金，價錢 p\nconst payback = (d, p) => { const n = Math.ceil(p / d), left = daysLeft(); return n <= left ? `约 ${n} 天回本（还剩 ${left} 场）` : `<span class=\"bad\">还剩 ${left} 场，回不了本</span>`; };\nfunction previewTx(k) {\n  const p = priceOf(k);\n  if (RELICS[k]) {\n    if (k === 'qinshi') return `四张链每天约 +3 金；${payback(3, p)}`;\n    if (k === 'gujing') return `每天开得正 +3 金；${payback(3, p)}`;\n    if (k === 'cha') return '完美的机会从一半变成三分之二：一场多三四金';\n    if (k === 'lian') return '多一格：多带一张回家，或多一张卸妆';\n    if (k === 'jin') return '她擦一次 3 层：上四张，只要再弃一张';\n    if (k === 'you') return '灭灯只熄 1（熄过一回，就到不了美满）';\n    if (k === 'luo') return '每天接错一次不伤她';\n    return '';\n  }\n  const deck = S.deck.map(c => c.t), base = bestLineGold(deck), more = bestLineGold([...deck, k]);\n  const d = more - base;\n  const tp = T[k], why = tp.wild ? '断了的链靠它接回来' : tp.clean ? '脸上少一层，省一张卸妆的牌' : '';\n  return d > 0 ? `放进今天的四张链：<b>+${d} 金</b>${tp.heavy ? '，多一层油彩' : tp.clean ? '，还少一层油彩' : ''}；起手天天换，${payback(Math.max(1, d / 2), p)}` : why ? `今天的链用不上它；${why}` : `今天起手${FAM[starterOf(S)]?.n || ''}用不上，换个日子再看`;\n}\n// 買了以後掉到第幾：照現在的水牌算\nfunction afterBuy(k) {\n  const p = priceOf(k), r0 = rankOf(S);\n  S.gold -= p; const r1 = rankOf(S); S.gold += p;\n  const ne = nextExam(S), risk = ne && r1 >= ne.fail;\n  return `买了：卖座 ${S.gold} → ${S.gold - p}，水牌第 ${r0} → <b class=\"${r1 > r0 ? 'bad' : ''}\">${r1}</b>${risk ? `<br><span class=\"bad\">第 ${ne.day} 天考核${examTx(ne)}，小心</span>` : ''}`;\n}\n// 後台：孫師父每天兩張牌、一樣物件\nfunction shopPanel() {\n  const t = S.T;\n  const cells = t.offers.map(k => {\n    const sold = t.sold.includes(k) || S.relics.includes(k), can = canBuy(S, k), rel = RELICS[k];\n    const ico = rel ? relicIcon(k, 176) : '';\n    const pic = rel ? (ico ? `<div class=\"relic pic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"${ico}\" alt=\"\"><span>${rel.n}</span></div>` : `<div class=\"relic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">${rel.n[0]}</div>`) : `<img src=\"${cardArt(k, 'stage').url}\" alt=\"${T[k].n}\" data-t=\"${k}\" class=\"spc\" style=\"width:96px;height:144px\">`;\n    const kw = rel ? `<b>物件 · ${rel.n}</b><br>${rel.tx}<br>买一次，整季都有用。` : `${stageLines(k).join('<br>')}<br>背面 ${HOME[FAM[T[k].f].home].n}`;\n    return `<div class=\"offer ${sold ? 'sold' : ''} ${rel ? 'isrel' : ''}\">${pic}\n      <div class=\"kw\">${kw}</div><div class=\"pv\">${previewTx(k)}</div><div class=\"pr\">${priceOf(k)} 金</div>${sold ? '' : `<div class=\"pv ab\">${afterBuy(k)}</div>`}\n      <button class=\"btn small ${can ? 'go' : ''}\" data-act=\"buy\" data-arg=\"${k}\" ${can ? '' : 'disabled'}>${sold ? '买下了' : can ? '买' : '钱不够'}</button></div>`;\n  }).join('');\n  return `<div class=\"panel shopp\"><h2>后台 · 孙师父<button class=\"btn small\" style=\"float:right\" data-act=\"close\">回桌上</button></h2>\n    ${portraitURL('孙师父') ? `<div class=\"sunq\"><img class=\"pt\" src=\"${portraitURL('孙师父')}\" alt=\"孙师父\"><p class=\"note\">“这几张，是我年轻时候的看家本事。拿去，别糟践了。”</p></div>` : '<p class=\"note\">“这几张，是我年轻时候的看家本事。拿去，别糟践了。”</p>'}\n    <div class=\"purse\"><span>卖座<b>${S.gold}</b></span><span>水牌第<b>${rankOf(S)}</b></span><span>还剩 <b>${daysLeft()}</b> 场</span></div>\n    <p class=\"note\">只有一种金：花的就是卖座，买了水牌马上往下掉，要靠往后几天多挣回来。买下的牌进卡组，以后每天都能装；物件买一次整季都在。明天孙师父换一批。</p>\n    ${S.relics.length ? `<p class=\"note\">你已经有：${S.relics.map(r => RELICS[r].n).join('、')}</p>` : ''}\n    <div class=\"shop\">${cells}</div></div>`;\n}\nfunction waterPanel() {\n  const ev = eventOf(S), k = S.events[S.day];\n  return `<div class=\"panel\"><h2>水牌<button class=\"btn small\" style=\"float:right\" data-act=\"close\">关上</button></h2>\n    <p class=\"note\">记到第 ${boardDay(S)} 天。每天散戏后，加上当天挣的卖座。</p>${boardHTML()}\n    ${ev ? `<p class=\"note\">今天：${EV_TX[k]()}</p>` : ''}</div>`;\n}\nfunction rulesPanel() {\n  const P = S.played;\n  return `<div class=\"panel rules\"><h2>规矩<button class=\"btn small\" style=\"float:right\" data-act=\"close\">关上</button></h2>\n    <h4>内账（试玩用）</h4><div class=\"ledger\"><span>卖座 ${S.gold}</span><span>花掉 ${S.spent}</span><span>灯 ${S.lamp}</span><span>痕 ${S.scars}</span><span>灭灯 ${S.outs}</span><span>底色 ${S.base}</span><span>满足 ${S.met.join('/')}</span><span>小凤 +${S.fengGold}</span><span>唱 ${P.sing} 念 ${P.speak}</span><span>做 ${P.act} 打 ${P.fight}</span><span>水牌第 ${rankOf(S)}</span></div>\n    <h4>技巧</h4><ul class=\"tips\">${TIPS.map(r => `<li>${r}</li>`).join('')}</ul>\n    <h4>待你确认：可以开关</h4><ul>\n      <li>「开得正」+1 金：<button class=\"btn small\" data-act=\"opt\" data-arg=\"open\" aria-pressed=\"${S.opt.open}\">${S.opt.open ? '保留' : '不要'}</button></li>\n    </ul>\n    <h4>待你确认：还没定</h4><ul>${PENDING.map(r => `<li>${r}</li>`).join('')}</ul>\n    <h4>规矩</h4><ol>${RULES.map(r => `<li>${termify(r)}</li>`).join('')}</ol>\n    <h4>设定没写死、原型自拟的</h4><ul>${ASSUME.map(r => `<li>${r}</li>`).join('')}</ul>\n    <div class=\"acts\"><button class=\"btn\" data-act=\"mute\">${muted ? '开声音' : '关声音'}</button><button class=\"btn\" data-act=\"again\">重开一局</button></div></div>`;\n}\nfunction boardHTML() {\n  return `<ol class=\"board\">${boardOf(S).map((r, i) => `<li class=\"${r.me ? 'me' : ''}\"><span>${i + 1}. ${r.me ? '' : faceTag(r.n)}${esc(r.n)}</span><span>${r.g}</span></li>`).join('')}</ol>`;\n}\nfunction sheetPanel() {\n  const k = sheet.k;\n  if (k === 'board') {\n    const a = actOf(S.day), ex = examOf(S);\n    return `<div class=\"panel\"><h2>水牌 · 考核</h2><p class=\"note\">第${'一二三'[a]}幕${ACT_N[a]}，到这里。魏老板看水牌定去留：${examTx(ex)}，排到第 ${ex.fail} 名${ex.fail < R.ranks ? '或更后' : ''}就摘牌。</p>${boardHTML()}\n      ${ex.pass ? `<p>你排第 ${ex.rank}，留下了。${a === 0 ? `第 7 天还有一次：${examTx(nextExam({ day: 4 }))}。` : ''}</p><div class=\"acts\"><button class=\"btn go\" data-act=\"nextact\">第${'一二三'[a + 1]}幕</button></div>`\n    : `<p class=\"fired\">你排第 ${ex.rank}。魏老板把你的牌子摘了下来。</p><p class=\"note\">这一季到这里为止。回家，最后一次卸妆。</p><div class=\"acts\"><button class=\"btn go\" data-act=\"nextact\">摘牌，回家</button></div>`}</div>`;\n  }\n  if (k === 'mirror') return mirrorPanel();\n  if (k === 'r_board') {\n    const rk = rankOf(S);\n    const tx = S.fired ? `第 ${S.fired} 天的考核，你排第 ${rk}。魏老板把你的牌子摘了下来。` : S.left ? `她走的那天，是第 ${S.left} 天。水牌上，你排第 ${rk}。` : rk === R.ranks ? '你的名字被摘了下来。' : rk === 1 ? '最上面那块牌子，写的是你。' : '';\n    return `<div class=\"panel\"><h2>水牌</h2>${boardHTML()}<p class=\"note\">${tx}${S.choice === 'cover' ? '小凤的名字还挂着。' : ''}</p><div class=\"acts\"><button class=\"btn go\" data-act=\"rstep\" data-arg=\"r_home\">回家</button></div></div>`;\n  }\n  if (k === 'r_home') {\n    const seat = seatEmpty(S) || wifeOf(S) === 2;\n    const tx = S.left ? `灯坊对面的椅子空着。那盏灯搁在桌上：糊了 ${Math.min(LSEG, Math.floor(S.lamp / 2))} 片纸（糊满要 ${LSEG} 片），熄过 ${S.outs} 回，划了 ${S.scars} 道。没糊完。`\n      : S.fired ? (wifeOf(S) === 0 ? '你素着脸回家，比平时早。她愣了一下，把灯骨推过来：“正好，帮我糊完。”' : '你回家比平时早。她没问，给你盛了饭。灯上有几处熄过。')\n      : S.lit ? `灯亮着，${seat ? '是你自己点的。对面的椅子空着。' : '你们一起点的。'}${S.lamp < R.happyLamp ? '有几处熄过，补不回来了。' : ''}` : S.litAlone ? '你回来时，灯已经亮了。是她一个人点的。' : seat ? '对面的椅子空着。灯没有点。' : '灯还搁在桌上，没有点。她抬头看了你一下。';\n    return `<div class=\"panel\"><h2>回家</h2><p>${tx}</p><div class=\"acts\"><button class=\"btn go\" data-act=\"rstep\" data-arg=\"r_chest\">打开木匣</button></div></div>`;\n  }\n  if (k === 'r_chest') {\n    const days = Array.from({ length: endDay(S) }, (_, i) => { const L = S.chest.filter(c => c.day === i + 1); return `<div>第 ${i + 1} 天<div class=\"cl\">${L.map(c => `<i style=\"background:${FCOL[c.f]}\"></i>`).join('') || ''}</div></div>`; }).join('');\n    return `<div class=\"panel\"><h2>木匣</h2><p class=\"note\">${S.chest.some(c => !c.last) ? `她替你擦过 ${S.chest.filter(c => !c.last).length} 层。每一块布都叠着，按日子放好。${S.chest.some(c => c.last) ? '最上面那一块，是最后一回。' : ''}` : S.chest.length ? '木匣里只有一块布，是最后一回。在那之前，她一次也没替你擦过。' : '木匣是空的。她一次也没替你擦过。'}</p><div class=\"book\">${days}</div><div class=\"acts\"><button class=\"btn go\" data-act=\"rfinal\">合上</button></div></div>`;\n  }\n  return '';\n}\n// 第二幕末的鏡子：台上演得最多的那一族，已經滲進臉裡；第三幕起，那一族推給她就帶著台上的字\nconst topFams = () => (S ? Object.keys(S.played).sort((a, b) => S.played[b] - S.played[a]) : ['sing']);\nfunction mirrorPanel() {\n  const [f1, f2] = topFams(), h1 = HOME[FAM[f1].home], card = BASIC.find(t => T[t].f === f1), over = S.base >= R.overBase[0];\n  const pics = (a, b) => `<div class=\"mirrorc\"><figure><img src=\"${cardArt(card, 'home').url}\" alt=\"\">${a}</figure><figure><img src=\"${cardArt(card, 'home', true).url}\" alt=\"\">${b}</figure></div>`;\n  const body = over\n    ? `<p>你对着镜子卸完妆。脸上还有一层${fc(f1)}的颜色——不是今天的油彩，是这几天一层层渗进去的，怎么擦都在。</p>${pics('你想给她的', '她听见的')}\n       <p>明天起（第三幕），你推给她的「${h1.n}」会带着台上的字。她听见的不是你，是戏：这一族推出去就算被染，灯上留一道痕。${S.base >= R.overBase[1] ? `底色已经到 ${R.overBase[1]}，${fc(f2)}那一族也一样。` : `底色到 ${R.overBase[1]}，演得第二多的那一族也会这样。`}</p>`\n    : `<p>你对着镜子卸完妆。镜子里，是你自己的脸。</p>${pics('现在', `底色到 ${R.overBase[0]} 以后`)}\n       <p>这几天你演得最多的是${fc(f1)}（${S.played[f1]} 张）。每晚没卸掉的油彩，睡一觉就渗进脸里，变成底色。第三幕里，底色到 ${R.overBase[0]}，你推给她的「${h1.n}」就会带着台上的字——推出去，就算被染。</p>`;\n  return `<div class=\"panel\"><h2>镜子</h2>${body}<p class=\"note\">现在底色 ${S.base}。底色只会多，不会少；每 2 点，妆匣少一格。</p><div class=\"acts\"><button class=\"btn go\" data-act=\"mirrorok\">睡吧</button></div></div>`;\n}\nfunction renderChoices() {\n  const opts = [], t = S.T;\n  const o = (label, act, sub, disabled, arg, pri) => opts.push(`<button class=\"opt ${pri ? 'pri' : ''}\" data-act=\"${act}\" ${arg !== undefined ? `data-arg=\"${arg}\"` : ''} ${disabled ? 'disabled' : ''}>${label}${sub ? `<small>${sub}</small>` : ''}</button>`);\n  if (busy || panel === 'rules' || sheet) { $('#choices').innerHTML = ''; return; }\n  const n = t.layers.length;\n  if (view === 'morning') {\n    const st = starterOf(S), yes = canDepart(S);\n    if (S.day !== R.days || S.choice) o(S.choice === 'lamp' ? '回家' : '出门', 'depart', yes ? (S.choice === 'lamp' ? '今天不上台' : '') : `还没带${st ? FAM[st].n : ''}`, !yes, undefined, yes);\n  }\n  if (view === 'stage') {\n    const stuck = !t.box.some(id => !t.used[id] && canStage(S, id) && (!t.plays.length || fits(S, id)));\n    if (t.ended) o(S.choice === 'stage' ? '散戏' : '回家', 'todoor', '', false, undefined, true);\n    else o('收场', 'endstage', t.plays.length ? `脸上 ${n} 层` : '今天不上台', false, undefined, t.plays.length >= t.stageMax || (t.plays.length > 0 && stuck));\n  }\n  if (view === 'door') {\n    if (S.day > 1 && S.scars <= R.wipeScarMax && canWipe(S)) o('让她擦', 'wipe', `${Math.min(R.wipeLayers, n)} 层 · 今晚只推 1 张`);\n    const dye = S.day === 1 ? 0 : dyeOf(S);\n    o(S.day === 1 ? '回去歇了' : '进门', 'enter', dye ? `前 ${dye} 张会被染` : '', false, undefined, !n || S.day === 1);\n  }\n  if (view === 'evening') {\n    if (S.choice === 'lamp') o('点灯', 'light', seatEmpty(S) ? '你一个人' : '她把火递给你', false, undefined, true);\n    else {\n      const ok = t.need.items.every(x => (t.got[x.look] || 0) >= x.n), full = t.pushed.length >= t.homeCap || !t.box.some(id => !t.used[id] && canHome(S, id));\n      o('吃完了', 'endeve', ok ? '' : '不够：灯会熄一截', false, undefined, ok || full);\n    }\n  }\n  if (view === 'night') o('睡吧', 'sleep', '', false, undefined, true);\n  $('#choices').innerHTML = opts.join('');\n}\nfunction renderHand() {\n  const h = $('#hand'), lb = $('#handLabel');\n  const show = ['morning', 'stage', 'door', 'evening', 'night'].includes(view) && !panel && !sheet && !(view === 'stage' && S.T.ended) && S.choice !== 'lamp';\n  h.classList.toggle('on', show);\n  if (!show) { h.innerHTML = ''; lb.innerHTML = ''; fitHand(); return; }\n  const t = S.T, side = view === 'evening' ? 'home' : 'stage', ids = t.box.filter(id => !t.used[id]);\n  const covered = view === 'evening' ? coveredFams(S) : [];\n  const can = id => {\n    if (busy) return false;\n    if (view === 'stage') return canStage(S, id);\n    if (view === 'evening') return canHome(S, id);\n    if (view === 'door' || view === 'night') return canClean(S, id);\n    return view === 'morning' && !lockedBox(S);\n  };\n  const hot = id => {\n    if (busy) return false;\n    if (view === 'stage') return canStage(S, id) && (!S.T.plays.length || fits(S, id)) && !keepHint(id);\n    if (view === 'evening') return canHome(S, id) && isMatch(S, id) && lack(S, lookOfCard(S, id)) > 0 && !willDye(S, id);\n    return false;\n  };\n  const n = ids.length, mid = (n - 1) / 2;\n  h.innerHTML = ids.map((id, i) => {\n    const c = cardOf(S, id), ok = can(id), tp = T[c.t];\n    const rot = (i - mid) * Math.min(2.6, 24 / Math.max(n, 1)), lift = Math.abs(i - mid) * 1.3;\n    const label = tp.home ? `${tp.n}，家常牌，不上台，背面${HOME[FAM[tp.f].home].n}` : `${tp.n}，${FAM[tp.f].n}，金 ${tp.g}，接${nextN(tp)}${kwOf(tp) ? `，${kwOf(tp)}` : ''}，背面${tp.blank ? '空白' : HOME[FAM[tp.f].home].n}`;\n    const dim = !ok && view !== 'morning';\n    const home = ['morning', 'stage', 'door'].includes(view) && keepHint(id);\n    return `<button class=\"hc ${ok ? 'play' : ''} ${hot(id) ? 'hot' : ''} ${dim ? 'off' : ''} ${home ? 'want' : ''}\" data-id=\"${id}\" ${tp.wild ? 'data-wild=\"1\"' : ''} style=\"transform:translateY(${lift}px) rotate(${rot}deg)\" ${ok ? `data-act=\"card\" data-arg=\"${id}\"` : 'disabled'} aria-label=\"${esc(label)}${home ? '，她今晚要的' : ''}\"><img src=\"${cardArt(c.t, side, covered.includes(tp.f) && !tp.home).url}\" alt=\"\">${view === 'evening' && canHome(S, id) && willDye(S, id) ? '<span class=\"stain\"></span>' : ''}${home ? '<span class=\"wtag\" aria-hidden=\"true\">家</span>' : ''}</button>`;\n  }).join('');\n  const tx = {\n    morning: lockedBox(S) ? '' : t.box.length ? '妆匣里的 · 点一张拿回去' : '妆匣是空的',\n    stage: ids.some(keepHint) ? '金框的能打 · 印着「家」的留着回家' : '',\n    door: t.layers.length ? '点一张牌卸一层' : '',\n    evening: t.pushed.length >= t.homeCap ? '她听不下了' : '点牌推给她',\n    night: t.layers.length ? '点一张牌卸一层' : '',\n  }[view];\n  // 裝匣的兩個按鈕跟著妝匣\n  const tools = view === 'morning' && !lockedBox(S) ? `<button class=\"mini\" data-act=\"yesterday\" ${S.lastBox ? '' : 'disabled'}>照昨天装</button><button class=\"mini\" data-act=\"clear\" ${t.box.length ? '' : 'disabled'}>全拿出来</button>` : '';\n  lb.innerHTML = `${tx ? `<span class=\"hlb\">${esc(tx)}</span>` : ''}${tools}`;\n}\n// 第一人稱時，臉上沒卸的台上臉化成螢幕四邊的油彩\nfunction renderSmear() {\n  const cv = $('#smear'), w = innerWidth, h = innerHeight;\n  if (cv.width !== w || cv.height !== h) { cv.width = w; cv.height = h; }\n  const x = cv.getContext('2d'); x.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);\n  if (!S || !['door', 'evening', 'night'].includes(view)) return;\n  const m = Math.min(w, h);\n  S.T.layers.forEach((ly, i) => {\n    const r = rng(101 + i * 977), col = hexRgb(FCOL[ly.f]);\n    for (let k = 0; k < 7; k++) {\n      const side = Math.floor(r() * 4); let px, py;\n      if (side === 0) { px = r() * w; py = -h * 0.04 + r() * h * 0.1; } else if (side === 1) { px = r() * w; py = h * 1.02 - r() * h * 0.08; } else if (side === 2) { px = -w * 0.02 + r() * w * 0.07; py = r() * h; } else { px = w * 1.02 - r() * w * 0.07; py = r() * h; }\n      const rad = (0.1 + r() * 0.14) * m, g = x.createRadialGradient(px, py, 0, px, py, rad);\n      g.addColorStop(0, `rgba(${col},.55)`); g.addColorStop(0.55, `rgba(${col},.22)`); g.addColorStop(1, `rgba(${col},0)`);\n      x.fillStyle = g; x.beginPath(); x.arc(px, py, rad, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n    }\n  });\n}\nasync function ink(fn) {\n  const el = $('#ink');\n  if (calm()) { fn(); return; }\n  el.className = ''; void el.offsetWidth; el.className = 'on';\n  await wait(600); fn(); refresh(); await wait(100);\n  el.className = 'off'; await wait(460); el.className = '';\n}\nasync function fly(id, where) {\n  const el = document.querySelector(`.hc[data-id=\"${id}\"]`), t = cardOf(S, id).t, side = where === 'home' ? 'home' : 'stage';\n  const target = !glOK ? null : where === 'stage' ? cardSpot('stage', S.T.plays.length) : where === 'home' ? cardSpot('home', S.T.pushed.length) : null;\n  if (el && !calm()) {\n    const r = el.getBoundingClientRect(), ghost = new Image();\n    ghost.src = cardArt(t, side).url; ghost.className = 'ghost'; Object.assign(ghost.style, { left: r.left + 'px', top: r.top + 'px', width: r.width + 'px', height: r.height + 'px' });\n    document.body.appendChild(ghost); el.style.visibility = 'hidden';\n    let tx = innerWidth / 2, ty = innerHeight * 0.45;\n    if (glOK && target) { const v = target.clone().project(camera); tx = (v.x + 1) / 2 * innerWidth; ty = (1 - v.y) / 2 * innerHeight; }\n    if (!target && where === 'cloth') ty = innerHeight + 80;\n    const anim = ghost.animate([{ transform: 'none', opacity: 1 }, { transform: `translate(${tx - r.left - r.width / 2}px, ${ty - r.top - r.height / 2}px) scale(${target ? 0.32 : 0.5}) rotate(${where === 'cloth' ? 40 : 8}deg)`, opacity: where === 'cloth' ? 0 : 0.95 }], { duration: 400, easing: 'cubic-bezier(.3,.7,.3,1)' });\n    await Promise.race([anim.finished.catch(() => {}), wait(700)]);\n    ghost.remove();\n  }\n  if (target) spawnCard(t, side, target);\n}\nfunction burst(n) {\n  if (calm()) return;\n  const fx = $('#fx'), gold = document.documentElement.classList.contains('a-gold');\n  for (let i = 0; i < Math.min(n, 44); i++) {\n    const f = document.createElement('span'); f.className = 'fleck';\n    f.style.left = `${8 + Math.random() * 84}vw`; f.style.animationDelay = `${Math.random() * 0.5}s`;\n    // v1.6：金箔圖集（4×4）隨機取一片；沒有圖就是 v1.5 的金色小方塊\n    if (gold) { const k = Math.floor(Math.random() * 16); f.style.backgroundPosition = `${(k % 4) * 100 / 3}% ${Math.floor(k / 4) * 100 / 3}%`; } else f.style.background = Math.random() < 0.3 ? '#efe2c2' : '#b8913f';\n    fx.appendChild(f); setTimeout(() => f.remove(), 2600);\n  }\n}\nfunction stamp(text) { const s = document.createElement('div'); s.className = 'stamp'; s.textContent = text; document.body.appendChild(s); setTimeout(() => s.remove(), 1800); }\nconst PIPS = { 1: [4], 2: [0, 8], 3: [0, 4, 8], 4: [0, 2, 6, 8], 5: [0, 2, 4, 6, 8], 6: [0, 2, 3, 5, 6, 8] };\nconst dieHTML = (v, cls = '') => `<span class=\"die ${cls} ${v === 1 || v === 4 ? 'red' : ''}\" aria-hidden=\"true\">${Array.from({ length: 9 }, (_, i) => `<i class=\"${PIPS[v].includes(i) ? 'on' : ''}\"></i>`).join('')}</span>`;\nasync function showDice(o) {\n  const el = $('#dice');\n  el.hidden = false;\n  el.innerHTML = `<div class=\"dbox\" role=\"status\"><span class=\"lb\">${esc(o.label)}</span><span class=\"dslot\">${dieHTML(1)}</span><span class=\"res\"></span></div>`;\n  const slot = el.querySelector('.dslot'), res = el.querySelector('.res');\n  if (!calm()) for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) { slot.innerHTML = dieHTML(1 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 6), 'spin'); await wait(65); }\n  slot.innerHTML = dieHTML(o.v, 'land');\n  res.className = `res ${o.ok ? 'ok' : 'bad'}`;\n  res.textContent = `${o.v}　${o.result}`;\n  await wait(calm() ? 900 : 1300);\n  el.hidden = true;\n}\n// ── 觀眾的話：對白框貼在剪紙頭頂；情報金框、同門紅框，說完就散 ──\nlet bubs = [];\nconst SPEAK = { L: [0, 1, 2], R: [6, 7, 8], C: [3, 5] };\nfunction bubble(html, kind = 'n', o = {}) {\n  if (view !== 'stage') return null;\n  if (kind === 'n' && (coach.lesson || nudge.k)) return null;\n  const busyI = bubs.map(b => b.i);\n  let pool = (kind === 'intel' || kind === 'ev' ? [...SPEAK.L, ...SPEAK.R] : [...SPEAK.L, ...SPEAK.R, ...SPEAK.C]).filter(i => !busyI.includes(i));\n  if (o.side) pool = pool.filter(i => SPEAK[o.side].includes(i));\n  // 情報與同門的話，各佔一邊，不擋戲台中間\n  if (kind === 'intel' && bubs.some(b => b.kind === 'ev')) pool = pool.filter(i => SPEAK[bubs.find(b => b.kind === 'ev').i <= 2 ? 'R' : 'L'].includes(i));\n  const i = pool.length ? pool[Math.floor(Math.random() * pool.length)] : 0;\n  const el = document.createElement('div');\n  el.className = `bub ${kind}`;\n  el.innerHTML = `${kind === 'intel' ? '<span class=\"tg\">情报 · 台下</span>' : kind === 'ev' ? '<span class=\"tg\">同门的事</span>' : ''}${html}`;\n  $('#talkb').appendChild(el);\n  const b = { el, i, kind, until: performance.now() + (kind === 'intel' ? 14000 : kind === 'ev' ? 5500 : 2600) };\n  // 同一個人換一句：舊的先收\n  bubs.filter(x => x.kind === 'n' && kind === 'n').slice(0, -1).forEach(x => { x.until = 0; });\n  bubs.push(b);\n  placeBub(b);\n  return b;\n}\nfunction placeBub(b) {\n  const h = crowdHead(b.i) || { x: innerWidth * (b.i <= 2 ? 0.16 : b.i >= 6 ? 0.84 : 0.5), y: innerHeight * 0.66 };\n  const w = b.el.offsetWidth, ht = b.el.offsetHeight;\n  const x = clamp(h.x, w / 2 + 8, innerWidth - w / 2 - 8), y = clamp(h.y - 8, ht + 8, innerHeight - 8);\n  b.el.style.left = `${x}px`; b.el.style.top = `${y}px`;\n  b.el.style.setProperty('--ax', `${clamp(h.x - (x - w / 2), 16, w - 16)}px`);\n}\nfunction bubTick() {\n  const now = performance.now();\n  bubs = bubs.filter(b => {\n    if (now < b.until || (b.kind === 'intel' && coach.lesson === 'crowd')) { placeBub(b); return true; }\n    b.el.classList.add('out'); setTimeout(() => b.el.remove(), 360);\n    return false;\n  });\n}\nsetInterval(bubTick, 120);\nfunction clearBubs() { bubs.forEach(b => b.el.remove()); bubs = []; }\n// 台下閒聊：沒人說話的時候，隔一陣有人開口；同門的事、戲台的事\nconst CHATTER = [`金宝今儿${K('嗓子')}不错。`, `月仙在侧幕${K('盯着你')}呢。`, `魏老板说，元宵要${K('定新头牌')}。`, '后排的，往前挤挤。', '今儿的灯笼是新换的。', `玉楼那张嘴，${K('什么都知道')}。`, '这出戏，我看过三回了。', `小凤的${K('嗓子')}，不知好了没有。`];\nconst chat = { day: 0, n: 0 };\nconst chatMax = () => (S.day === 1 ? 2 : !S.tut.off && S.day <= 2 ? 3 : 6);\nsetInterval(() => {\n  if (view !== 'stage' || busy || !S || S.T.ended || bubs.length >= 2 || document.hidden || coachOn() || panel) return;\n  if (chat.day !== S.day) { chat.day = S.day; chat.n = 0; }\n  if (chat.n >= chatMax()) return;\n  chat.n += 1;\n  bubble(pick(CHATTER), 'n', { side: Math.random() < 0.5 ? 'L' : 'R' });\n}, 7000);\n\n// ── 台上的特效：紙屑、金箔、彩綢、墨點、煙花（畫在 3D 上面、字的下面）──\nconst fxc = $('#stagefx'), fxx = fxc.getContext('2d');\nlet parts = [], fxOn = false, fxLast = 0;\nconst FXCOL = { petal: ['#c8283a', '#e0475a', '#f2d48a', '#efe2c8', '#a8202b'], foil: ['#f6dc96', '#e8c46a', '#fff3cf'], spark: ['#ffe9a8', '#f2d48a', '#fff'], ink: ['#120e11', '#2b2427', '#3a0a0e'], fw: ['#ffe9a8', '#ff8a6a', '#f2d48a', '#ffd0dc', '#fff'], burnt: ['#7d1219', '#3a0a0e', '#a8202b'] };\n// v1.6：特效圖集（4×4 格，每格 256）切成小張：紙屑、金箔、墨點、燒紙；彩綢是一條長圖。沒有圖就用 v1.5 的色塊\nconst FX_ATLAS = { petal: 'paper_flakes', foil: 'gold_leaf', ink: 'ink_drops', burnt: 'paper_burnt' }, fxSpr = {};\nfunction fxSprite(name, i) {\n  const k = `${name}|${i}`;\n  if (fxSpr[k] !== undefined) return fxSpr[k];\n  const im = artImg(`fx/${name}.png`);\n  if (!im) return (fxSpr[k] = null);\n  const cs = im.width / 4, c = document.createElement('canvas'); c.width = c.height = 96;\n  const x = c.getContext('2d'); x.imageSmoothingQuality = 'high'; x.drawImage(im, (i % 4) * cs, Math.floor(i / 4) * cs, cs, cs, 0, 0, 96, 96);\n  return (fxSpr[k] = c);\n}\n// 彩綢沿著波浪一段一段畫：原圖朱紅；金色那幾條染成金\nfunction fxRibbon(col) {\n  if (!artImg('fx/ribbon.png')) return null;\n  return col === '#c8283a' ? artTint('fx/ribbon.png', '#c8283a', 1024) : artTint('fx/ribbon.png', col, 1024);\n}\nfunction drawRibbon(img, p, len, W) {\n  const L = W * 0.55, N = 40, th = p.w * 3.4, bx = img.width * 0.026, bw = img.width * 0.948, by = img.height * 0.1, bh = img.height * 0.8;\n  const yAt = s0 => p.y0 + Math.sin(s0 * 0.018 + p.ph + p.t * 7) * 34 - s0 * 0.12;\n  for (let j = 0; j < N; j++) {\n    const s0 = j / N * L, s1 = (j + 1) / N * L;\n    if (s0 > len) break;\n    const xa = p.side < 0 ? s0 : W - s0, xb = p.side < 0 ? s1 : W - s1, ya = yAt(s0), yb = yAt(s1);\n    fxx.save(); fxx.translate(xa, ya); fxx.rotate(Math.atan2(yb - ya, xb - xa));\n    fxx.drawImage(img, bx + bw * j / N, by, bw / N, bh, 0, -th / 2, Math.hypot(xb - xa, yb - ya) + 1.5, th);\n    fxx.restore();\n  }\n}\nfunction fxSize() {\n  const d = Math.min(devicePixelRatio || 1, 2);\n  if (fxc.width !== Math.round(innerWidth * d) || fxc.height !== Math.round(innerHeight * d)) { fxc.width = Math.round(innerWidth * d); fxc.height = Math.round(innerHeight * d); }\n  fxx.setTransform(d, 0, 0, d, 0, 0);\n}\nfunction spawn(kind, n, o = {}) {\n  if (calm()) return;\n  if (view !== 'stage' && ['fw', 'foil', 'ribbon', 'petal'].includes(kind)) return;\n  fxSize();\n  const W = innerWidth, H = innerHeight;\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n    const p = { kind, t: 0, rot: Math.random() * 6.28, vr: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 9, col: pick(FXCOL[kind] || FXCOL.petal) };\n    if (kind === 'petal' || kind === 'foil') { p.x = Math.random() * W; p.y = -20 - Math.random() * H * 0.5; p.vx = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 70; p.vy = (kind === 'foil' ? 190 : 110) + Math.random() * 100; p.s = kind === 'foil' ? 5 + Math.random() * 7 : 7 + Math.random() * 9; p.life = 3.6; p.sw = Math.random() * 6.28; }\n    else if (kind === 'spark' || kind === 'fw') { const a = Math.random() * 6.28, v = (kind === 'fw' ? 180 : 120) + Math.random() * (kind === 'fw' ? 280 : 220); p.x = o.x; p.y = o.y; p.vx = Math.cos(a) * v; p.vy = Math.sin(a) * v - 70; p.s = 2 + Math.random() * 3; p.life = 0.7 + Math.random() * 0.6; }\n    else if (kind === 'ink') { const a = Math.random() * 6.28, v = 70 + Math.random() * 280; p.x = o.x; p.y = o.y; p.vx = Math.cos(a) * v; p.vy = Math.sin(a) * v - 90; p.s = 3 + Math.random() * 8; p.life = 0.9 + Math.random() * 0.5; }\n    else if (kind === 'ribbon') { p.side = i % 2 ? 1 : -1; p.y0 = H * (0.12 + Math.random() * 0.4); p.life = 2; p.ph = Math.random() * 6.28; p.col = i % 3 === 2 ? '#f2d48a' : '#c8283a'; p.w = 6 + Math.random() * 5; }\n    // 燒紙：燈熄、倒彩時從那裡飄下來，慢慢落\n    else if (kind === 'burnt') { p.x = o.x + (Math.random() - 0.5) * (o.w || 80); p.y = o.y + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 30; p.vx = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 60; p.vy = -40 + Math.random() * 50; p.s = 8 + Math.random() * 8; p.life = 2.2 + Math.random() * 0.9; p.sw = Math.random() * 6.28; p.vr *= 0.4; }\n    if (FX_ATLAS[kind]) p.spr = fxSprite(FX_ATLAS[kind], Math.floor(Math.random() * 16));\n    parts.push(p);\n  }\n  if (!fxOn) { fxOn = true; fxLast = performance.now(); requestAnimationFrame(fxLoop); }\n}\nfunction fxLoop(now) {\n  const dt = Math.min(0.05, (now - fxLast) / 1000), W = innerWidth;\n  fxLast = now;\n  fxx.clearRect(0, 0, W, innerHeight);\n  parts = parts.filter(p => (p.t += dt) < p.life);\n  for (const p of parts) {\n    fxx.globalAlpha = Math.min(1, (p.life - p.t) / 0.45);\n    if (p.kind === 'ribbon') {\n      const k = Math.min(1, p.t / (p.life * 0.55)), len = W * 0.55 * k, rb = fxRibbon(p.col);\n      if (rb) { drawRibbon(rb, p, len, W); continue; }\n      fxx.strokeStyle = p.col; fxx.lineWidth = p.w; fxx.lineCap = 'round'; fxx.beginPath();\n      for (let s0 = 0; s0 <= len; s0 += 12) { const x = p.side < 0 ? s0 : W - s0, y = p.y0 + Math.sin(s0 * 0.018 + p.ph + p.t * 7) * 34 - s0 * 0.12; if (s0) fxx.lineTo(x, y); else fxx.moveTo(x, y); }\n      fxx.stroke(); continue;\n    }\n    const grav = p.kind === 'petal' || p.kind === 'foil' ? 0 : p.kind === 'burnt' ? 80 : 520;\n    p.vy += grav * dt; p.x += (p.vx + (p.sw !== undefined ? Math.sin(p.t * 3 + p.sw) * 40 : 0)) * dt; p.y += p.vy * dt; p.rot += p.vr * dt;\n    fxx.save(); fxx.translate(p.x, p.y); fxx.rotate(p.rot); fxx.fillStyle = p.col;\n    if (p.spr) {\n      // 紙屑、燒紙翻面（壓扁再張開）；金箔閃一閃\n      const d = p.s * (p.kind === 'ink' ? 3.4 : 2.7);\n      if (p.kind === 'petal' || p.kind === 'burnt') fxx.scale(1, Math.max(0.18, Math.abs(Math.cos(p.t * 4 + p.sw))));\n      if (p.kind === 'foil') fxx.globalAlpha *= 0.65 + 0.35 * Math.abs(Math.sin(p.t * 9 + p.sw));\n      fxx.drawImage(p.spr, -d / 2, -d / 2, d, d);\n    }\n    else if (p.kind === 'petal') { fxx.beginPath(); fxx.ellipse(0, 0, p.s, Math.max(0.5, p.s * 0.5 * Math.abs(Math.cos(p.t * 4 + p.sw))), 0, 0, 6.28); fxx.fill(); }\n    else if (p.kind === 'foil') { fxx.globalAlpha *= 0.6 + 0.4 * Math.abs(Math.sin(p.t * 9 + p.sw)); fxx.fillRect(-p.s / 2, -p.s / 2, p.s, p.s * 0.7); }\n    else { fxx.beginPath(); fxx.arc(0, 0, p.s, 0, 6.28); fxx.fill(); }\n    fxx.restore();\n  }\n  fxx.globalAlpha = 1;\n  if (parts.length) requestAnimationFrame(fxLoop); else { fxOn = false; fxx.clearRect(0, 0, W, innerHeight); }\n}\n// 打出去那張牌在螢幕上的位置\nfunction cardScreen(i) {\n  if (!glOK) return { x: innerWidth / 2, y: innerHeight * 0.42 };\n  const v = cardSpot('stage', i).project(camera);\n  return { x: (v.x + 1) / 2 * innerWidth, y: (1 - v.y) / 2 * innerHeight };\n}\nfunction banner(tx, sub, cls = '') {\n  if (calm()) return;\n  $('#combo').innerHTML = `<div class=\"cb ${cls}\">${esc(tx)}</div>${sub ? `<div class=\"cs\">${esc(sub)}</div>` : ''}`;\n}\nfunction gainFloat(at, tx, bad) {\n  if (calm()) return;\n  const el = document.createElement('div'); el.className = `gainf ${bad ? 'bad' : ''}`; el.textContent = tx;\n  el.style.left = `${at.x}px`; el.style.top = `${at.y}px`; document.body.appendChild(el); setTimeout(() => el.remove(), 1300);\n}\n// 連擊越長，台上越熱鬧：火星 → 紙屑、幕晃、大字 → 金箔、彩綢、鏡頭推近 → 煙花\nconst COMBO_TX = { 3: ['好！', '连击 ×3'], 4: ['满堂红', '连击 ×4'], 5: ['绝了', '五连'] };\nfunction comboFx(p) {\n  const n = S.T.chain, at = cardScreen(S.T.plays.length - 1);\n  gainFloat(at, `+${p.g + p.extra + p.open + p.fin}`, p.broke);\n  if (p.broke) {\n    spawn('ink', 30, at); spawn('burnt', 7, at);\n    banner('倒彩', p.grudge ? '怨气 +1：今晚多染一张' : p.saved ? '小锣一响，这回不记怨气' : '连击归零', 'bad');\n    if (glOK) $('#gl').animate([{ filter: 'saturate(.15) brightness(.6)' }, { filter: 'none' }], { duration: 750, easing: 'ease-out' });\n    return;\n  }\n  spawn('spark', 10 + n * 8, at);\n  lanternKick = Math.min(1.6, 0.35 * n);\n  if (n >= 2) swayKick = Math.max(swayKick, 0.35 * n);\n  if (n >= 3) { spawn('petal', 40 + (n - 3) * 35); const b = COMBO_TX[Math.min(n, 5)]; banner(b[0], b[1], n >= 4 ? 'big' : ''); }\n  if (n >= 4) { spawn('foil', 80); spawn('ribbon', 6); if (glOK && camPos) camPos.lerp(camAim, 0.08); }\n  if (n >= 5) [0, 350, 700].forEach(d => setTimeout(() => spawn('fw', 60, { x: innerWidth * (0.2 + Math.random() * 0.6), y: innerHeight * (0.12 + Math.random() * 0.2) }), d));\n}\nasync function run(fn) { if (busy) return; busy = true; refresh(); try { await fn(); } finally { busy = false; refresh(); } }\n\n// ── 一天 ──\n// 依目前時段擺桌面（開局、接著玩都走這裡）\nfunction placeScene() {\n  if (view !== 'stage') { clearBubs(); stageHeat = 0; }\n  if (!glOK) return;\n  const lk = lookNow(S);\n  const v = { morning: ['table', 'day'], stage: ['stage', 'stage'], door: ['door', 'door'], evening: ['home', 'home'], night: ['night', 'night'], watch: ['night', 'night'], board: ['table', 'day'], lastwipe: ['mirror', 'night'], reveal: ['home', 'home'] }[view] || ['table', 'day'];\n  focus(v[0], v[1]);\n  const base = lk && (view === 'evening' || view === 'morning') && (view === 'evening' || actOf(S.day) === 0) ? LOOK_POSE[lk] : 'work';\n  wife.base = base;\n  // 第一幕她對你笑\n  wife.expr = { eyes: 'open', smile: actOf(S.day) === 0 };\n  wife.pose(base); wife.turn(0); wife.redraw();\n  actor.root.visible = view === 'stage';\n  crowdG.visible = view === 'stage';\n  if (view === 'stage') { actor.setLayers(S.T.layers); crowdDress(S.day); }\n  artScene(view);\n}\nfunction toDay() {\n  sheet = null; lookOpen = false;\n  view = S.phase;\n  clear3DCards();\n  placeScene();\n  if (glOK) actor.setLayers([]);\n  const st = starterOf(S), ev = eventOf(S), k = S.events[S.day];\n  if (view === 'stage') say('班主', DAY_TX[S.day - 1]);\n  else if (ev) sayH(ev.who, EV_TX[k](), esc(DAY_TX[S.day - 1]));\n  else say('', DAY_TX[S.day - 1]);\n  refresh();\n}\nfunction startGame(name) {\n  S = newGame(name, ((Date.now() % 2147483647) ^ Math.floor(Math.random() * 2147483647)) >>> 0);\n  S.tut = { off: !tutPref(), seen: {} };\n  saved = null; panel = null; coach.lesson = null;\n  $('#watch').hidden = true;\n  toDay();\n}\nfunction continueGame() {\n  S = saved; saved = null; panel = null; lookOpen = false;\n  S.tut = S.tut || { off: true, seen: {} };\n  coach.lesson = null;\n  view = S.phase; sheet = view === 'board' ? { k: 'board' } : view === 'reveal' ? { k: 'r_board' } : null;\n  placeScene();\n  if (view === 'watch') showWatch();\n  if (view === 'lastwipe') showWipe();\n  say('', `第 ${S.day} 天，接着来。`);\n  refresh();\n}\nconst onDepart = () => run(async () => {\n  depart(S);\n  if (S.phase === 'evening') { await ink(() => { view = 'evening'; placeScene(); }); say('', seatEmpty(S) ? '灯坊里只有你。灯骨搁在桌上。' : '她抬头看见你，没问你怎么没去。她把灯骨推过来。'); return; }\n  stageHeat = 0;\n  await ink(() => { view = 'stage'; placeScene(); actor?.setLayers([]); actor?.pose('idle'); });\n  say('班主', `起手${FAM[starterOf(S)].n}。${S.T.stageMax < R.stageMax ? '今天只有四张。' : ''}`);\n  const k = S.events[S.day];\n  if (k && EV_BUB[k]) setTimeout(() => bubble(EV_BUB[k], 'ev'), 700);\n  // 一上台，台下就有人聊她今晚的事\n  setTimeout(() => { if (view === 'stage' && !S.T.ended) crowdIntel(); }, 1500);\n});\n// 台下聊起她今晚的事：第 1 天在第二張之後，其餘天在第一張之後\nfunction crowdIntel() {\n  const t = S.T;\n  // 第 1 天傍晚是自動的，台下不聊她\n  if (S.day === 1 || t.heard || seatEmpty(S) || S.choice === 'stage' || S.choice === 'lamp') return;\n  if (!hearCrowd(S)) return;\n  const nd = needOf(S);\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    const html = `${CROWD_TX[nd.look]}${nd.items[1] ? `还有人说，${CROWD_B[nd.items[1].look]}` : ''}`;\n    bubble(`${html}<div><span class=\"itag\">今晚她要：${recipeShort(nd)}</span></div>`, 'intel');\n    refresh();\n  }, 650);\n}\nconst onStage = id => run(async () => {\n  const name = tOf(S, id).n, f = fOf(S, id);\n  await fly(id, 'stage');\n  const p = playStage(S, id);\n  if (!p) return;\n  if (actor) { actor.perform(f); actor.setLayers(S.T.layers); }\n  sfx(p.broke ? 'boo' : 'cheer');\n  const tp = tOf(S, id), t = S.T;\n  // 台下：起伏、說話；聚光燈跟著連擊亮起來\n  crowdKick(p.broke ? 'down' : t.chain >= 3 ? 'big' : 'up');\n  stageHeat = p.broke ? 0 : Math.min(2.4, (t.chain - 1) * 0.6);\n  if (glOK && p.broke) { lights.spot.color.setHex(0xff6a5a); setTimeout(() => lights.spot.color.setHex(0xffe0b0), 600); }\n  const pool = p.broke ? CROWD.broke : p.seeped ? CROWD.seep : p.fin ? CROWD.fin : tp.wild && (p.hit || p.open || t.plays.length === 1) ? CROWD.wild : tp.boost && p.hit ? CROWD.boost : tp.clean ? CROWD.clean : tp.heavy ? CROWD.heavy : tp.blank ? CROWD.blank : p.open ? CROWD.open : t.chain >= 3 ? CROWD.big : CROWD.hit;\n  // 第一天只在第一張和接錯時開口；教學框開著也不插嘴\n  if ((S.day > 1 || p.broke || t.plays.length === 1) && !coachOn()) bubble(esc(pick(pool)), p.broke ? 'boo' : 'n');\n  comboFx(p);\n  if (p.broke) say('', p.grudge ? '台下一声低低的嘘，跟着你下了台。' : '台下一声低低的嘘。', p.grudge ? '接错了 · 怨气 +1' : '接错了');\n  else if (p.seeped) say('', '这一层没挂住，直接渗了进去。', p.extra ? `连击 +${p.extra} 金` : '');\n  else if (p.open) sayN(`开得正 +${p.open} 金`);\n  else if (t.plays.length === 1 && tp.wild) sayN('百搭起手');\n  else sayN(`连击 ×${t.chain} · 多 ${p.extra} 金${tp.boost ? '（托）' : ''}${p.fin ? ` · 压轴 +${p.fin}` : ''}${tp.heavy ? ' · 两层' : ''}${tp.clean ? ' · 不上妆' : ''}`);\n  crowdIntel();\n});\nconst onEndStage = () => run(async () => {\n  endStage(S);\n  const t = S.T;\n  if (t.die !== null) await showDice({ label: '连击到 3：掷到 4 以上，金 ×1.5', v: t.die, ok: t.perfect, result: t.perfect ? '完美' : '没中，不扣金' });\n  if (t.gold) { burst(t.gold * 2); sfx('cheer'); crowdKick('big'); }\n  if (t.perfect) { stamp('完美'); bubble(esc(pick(CROWD.perfect)), 'n'); spawn('foil', 140); spawn('ribbon', 8); [0, 300, 600, 900].forEach(d => setTimeout(() => spawn('fw', 70, { x: innerWidth * (0.15 + Math.random() * 0.7), y: innerHeight * (0.1 + Math.random() * 0.25) }), d)); }\n  stageHeat = t.perfect ? 2.4 : 0.6;\n  actor?.pose('bow');\n  const who = S.choice === 'cover' ? `这 ${t.gold} 金，记在小凤名下。` : S.choice === 'stage' ? `元宵，金 ×2：${t.gold} 金。` : '';\n  say('班主', t.plays.length ? (who || `散戏。${t.gold} 金。`) : '今天你没有上台。');\n});\nconst onToDoor = () => run(async () => {\n  parts.length = 0;\n  if (S.phase === 'night') {\n    await ink(() => { view = 'night'; placeScene(); say('', ''); });\n    say('', '元宵的灯笼从窗外过去。你没有回家。', S.T.layers.length ? '剩下的牌还能卸。' : '');\n    return;\n  }\n  await ink(() => { view = 'door'; placeScene(); say('', ''); });\n  if (glOK && S.scars <= R.wipeScarMax && S.T.layers.length && !seatEmpty(S)) wife.pose('reach');\n  if (!S.T.layers.length) say('', '脸是干净的。');\n  else if (S.scars <= R.wipeScarMax) say('阿檀', '回来啦。擦一擦？');\n  else say('', '她坐着，没有起身。');\n});\nconst onWipe = () => run(async () => {\n  if (!canWipe(S)) return;\n  const n = Math.min(R.wipeLayers, S.T.layers.length), cols = S.T.layers.slice(-n).reverse().map(l => FCOL[l.f]);\n  if (glOK) { wife.pose('reach'); await wait(200); }\n  for (const c of cols) await towelSwipe(c);\n  wipe(S); renderSmear(); sfx('cloth');\n  say('阿檀', n === 2 ? '她替你擦掉两层，把毛巾叠起来，收进木匣。' : '她替你擦掉一层，把毛巾收进木匣。', '今晚她只听得下 1 张');\n  if (glOK) wife.pose(wife.base);\n});\nconst restTx = () => (S.T.layers.length ? `还剩 ${S.T.layers.length} 层。` : '脸上干净了。');\nconst onClean = id => run(async () => {\n  const name = tOf(S, id).n;\n  await fly(id, 'cloth');\n  selfClean(S, id); renderSmear(); sfx('cloth');\n  say('', `「${name}」成了一块布，挂上晾绳。${restTx()}`);\n});\nconst onEnter = () => run(async () => {\n  enterHome(S);\n  const t = S.T;\n  if (t.auto) {\n    await ink(() => { view = 'night'; placeScene(); say('', ''); });\n    say('', '她把饭留在桌上，灯又糊了一片。', '灯 +1');\n    await wait(2200);\n    if (t.forecast) { sayH('阿檀', foreTx(t.forecast), intelTag(t.forecast)); refresh(); }\n    // 不自動天亮：玩家看完、想好了，自己點「睡吧」\n    return;\n  }\n  if (t.emptySeat) {\n    await ink(() => { view = 'night'; placeScene(); say('', ''); });\n    say('', '对面的椅子空着。灯不再糊了。', t.layers.length ? '剩下的牌还能卸。' : '');\n    return;\n  }\n  await ink(() => { view = 'evening'; lookOpen = false; placeScene(); say('', ''); });\n  const nd = S.T.need;\n  sayH('阿檀', LOOK_TX[nd.look] + (nd.items[1] ? `“${ALSO_TX[nd.items[1].look]}”` : ''), S.T.dye ? `前 ${S.T.dye} 张会被染` : '');\n});\nconst onHome = id => run(async () => {\n  await fly(id, 'home');\n  const r = playHome(S, id);\n  if (!r) return;\n  if (r.dyed) {\n    wife?.react('down');\n    const txt = r.blank ? '她翻过来看。背面什么也没有。' : HOME[r.h].hurt;\n    say(`${r.name} · 被染`, txt, r.scar ? '灯上留了一道痕' : '这一道不算数');\n  } else if (r.blank) {\n    wife?.react('none');\n    say('空白', '她翻过来看。背面什么也没有。', '灯不涨');\n  } else {\n    wife?.react(r.match ? 'up' : 'none');\n    const nd = S.T.need;\n    say(`${r.name}${r.match ? ' · 对路' : ''}`, r.match ? (r.gift ? '她认出这是她给你的，眼睛亮了一下。' : pick(['她抬眼看你，手上慢了一下。', '她笑了一下，把灯骨转过来给你看。'])) : '她接过去，点点头。可这不是她今晚要的。', `${r.gain ? `灯 +${r.gain}` : '灯不涨'}${r.count === 2 ? ' · 算两张' : ''}`);\n  }\n  updateTable();\n  if (S.T.pushed.length >= S.T.homeCap && S.T.homeCap === R.homeAfterWipe) { await wait(1500); say('', '她累了，只听得下这一张。'); }\n});\n// 燈：十五片紙，每片 2 點；糊滿 30 才算美滿\nconst LSEG = 15, LANG = 360 / LSEG;\nfunction lampSVG(lamp, mark = {}) {\n  const cx = 75, cy = 75, r = 62, seg = [];\n  for (let i = 0; i < LSEG; i++) {\n    const a0 = (-90 + i * LANG) * Math.PI / 180, a1 = (-90 + (i + 1) * LANG) * Math.PI / 180, fill = clamp(lamp - i * 2, 0, 2) / 2;\n    seg.push(`<path class=\"sg ${mark[i] || ''}\" d=\"M${cx} ${cy}L${(cx + r * Math.cos(a0)).toFixed(1)} ${(cy + r * Math.sin(a0)).toFixed(1)}A${r} ${r} 0 0 1 ${(cx + r * Math.cos(a1)).toFixed(1)} ${(cy + r * Math.sin(a1)).toFixed(1)}Z\" fill=\"${fill ? '#c42433' : '#241d1f'}\" opacity=\"${fill && fill < 1 ? 0.55 : 1}\" stroke=\"#b89a5a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>`);\n  }\n  return `<svg class=\"lampsvg\" viewBox=\"0 0 150 150\" aria-hidden=\"true\">${seg.join('')}<circle cx=\"${cx}\" cy=\"${cy}\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#1c1719\" stroke=\"#b89a5a\"/>${lamp >= R.lampFull ? `<circle cx=\"${cx}\" cy=\"${cy}\" r=\"${r + 4}\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2d48a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>` : ''}</svg>`;\n}\n// 這幾片紙在兩個燈數之間變了\nconst segsBetween = (a, b) => { const m = {}; for (let i = 0; i < LSEG; i++) if (clamp(a - i * 2, 0, 2) !== clamp(b - i * 2, 0, 2)) m[i] = 1; return m; };\n// 吃完飯當場：燈亮了還是熄了一截，熄了第幾回，還剩幾回她就走\nasync function lampFeedback(t) {\n  const el = $('#lampfb'), now = S.lamp;\n  const from = t.met ? now - t.lampGain : now + t.lampOut;\n  const head = t.met ? `<div class=\"big\">她的需要，满足了</div>` : `<div class=\"big\">灯熄了一截</div>`;\n  const rows = t.met\n    ? `<div class=\"row\">今晚灯 <b>+${t.lampGain}</b>　现在 <b>${now}</b>/${R.lampFull}　（糊满才算美满）</div>${t.gift ? `<div class=\"row\">两晚都对上：她送你一张「${T[t.gift].n}」</div>` : ''}`\n    : `<div class=\"row\">灯 <b>${from}</b> → <b>${now}</b>　熄 ${outsHTML(true)} <b>${S.outs}</b>/${R.brokenOuts}</div><div class=\"warn\">${S.outs >= R.brokenOuts ? '熄满五回了。' : `她今晚要的是 ${recipeShort(t.need)}。再熄 ${R.brokenOuts - S.outs} 回，她就走了。${S.outs === 1 ? '熄过了，这一季到不了美满。' : ''}`}</div>`;\n  el.innerHTML = `<div class=\"lf ${t.met ? '' : 'bad'}\">${head}<div class=\"lp\">${lampSVG(from)}</div>${rows}<button class=\"btn go small lfok\">${t.met ? '好' : '知道了'}</button></div>`;\n  el.hidden = false;\n  sfx(t.met ? 'lit' : 'out');\n  // 看清楚了再點掉：不自動消失\n  const ok = el.querySelector('.lfok'), done = new Promise(res => ok.addEventListener('click', e => { e.stopPropagation(); res(); }, { once: true }));\n  ok.focus({ preventScroll: true });\n  const ch = segsBetween(from, now);\n  if (calm()) el.querySelector('.lp').innerHTML = lampSVG(now);\n  else {\n    await Promise.race([wait(650), done]);\n    if (t.met) el.querySelector('.lp').innerHTML = lampSVG(now, Object.fromEntries(Object.keys(ch).map(i => [i, 'lighting'])));\n    else { el.querySelectorAll('.sg').forEach((p, i) => { if (ch[i]) p.classList.add('dying'); }); await Promise.race([wait(1150), done]); el.querySelector('.lp').innerHTML = lampSVG(now); }\n  }\n  await done;\n  el.hidden = true; el.innerHTML = '';\n}\n// 3D 的燈：熄掉的幾片閃幾下滅了，燈光一暗；亮的時候燈光暖一下\nfunction lamp3D(from, to) {\n  if (!glOK || calm()) return;\n  const nf = Math.min(12, Math.round(from * 12 / R.lampFull)), nt = Math.min(12, Math.round(to * 12 / R.lampFull)), lit = !!(S.lit || S.litAlone);\n  if (to < from) {\n    const fade = lampPatches.slice(nt, nf);\n    let k = 0;\n    const iv = setInterval(() => { k += 1; fade.forEach(p => { p.visible = k % 2 === 0; }); if (k >= 8) { clearInterval(iv); fade.forEach(p => { p.visible = false; }); } }, 150);\n    lampLight.color.setHex(0xff4a32);\n    // v1.6：熄掉的燈紙燒成碎片，從燈那裡飄下來\n    [350, 850].forEach(d => setTimeout(() => { const v = lampLight.position.clone().project(camera); spawn('burnt', 5, { x: (v.x + 1) / 2 * innerWidth, y: (1 - v.y) / 2 * innerHeight, w: 90 }); }, d));\n    tween(1300, e => { lampLight.intensity = lit ? 1.7 : 1.3 * (1 - e); }).then(() => lampLight.color.setHex(0xff7a4a));\n  } else tween(1600, e => { lampLight.intensity = lit ? 1.7 : 1.5 * Math.sin(e * Math.PI); });\n}\n// 她走了：痕到 4，或燈熄滿 5 回\nconst LEAVE_TX = { outs: '“灯熄了五回。我一个人，糊不动了。”', scars: '“灯上划了四道。补不回来了。”' };\nasync function herLeaving() {\n  const why = S.outs >= R.brokenOuts ? 'outs' : 'scars';\n  if (glOK) { focus('home', 'night'); wife.react('down'); }\n  say('阿檀', LEAVE_TX[why]);\n  await wait(2800);\n  if (glOK) wife.root.visible = false;\n  sfx('cloth');\n  say('', '她把灯搁在桌上，起身走了。门开着，没关。');\n  banner('她走了', '这一季，到这里为止', 'bad slow');\n  await wait(3200);\n  await ink(() => { view = 'night'; placeScene(); say('', ''); });\n  say('', '屋里只剩你一个人。', '天亮以后，最后一次卸妆。');\n}\nconst onEndEvening = () => run(async () => {\n  const lamp0 = S.lamp;\n  endEvening(S);\n  const t = S.T, look = t.need.look;\n  // 先看她的需要：滿足了，或燈熄一截。當場就看到燈\n  if (t.met) {\n    wife?.react('up');\n    sayH('阿檀', esc(MET_TX[look]), t.gift ? `<span class=\"itag\">她送你一张家常牌「${T[t.gift].n}」：对上她的需要，一张算两张</span>` : '她今晚的需要，满足了');\n  } else {\n    wife?.react('down');\n    sayH('', `${esc(OUT_TX[look])}灯${K('熄了一截')}。`, `没推够（${recipeShort(t.need)}）：灯 −${t.lampOut}，熄了第 ${S.outs} 回`);\n  }\n  if (glOK) focus('lamp', 'home');\n  updateTable(); renderPlate(); lamp3D(lamp0, S.lamp);\n  await lampFeedback(t);\n  if (glOK) focus('home', 'home');\n  if (S.left) { await herLeaving(); return; }\n  await ink(() => { view = 'night'; placeScene(); say('', ''); });\n  const base = t.layers.length ? `镜子里还有 ${t.layers.length} 层，睡一觉就渗进底色。` : '';\n  // 一段的最後一晚：她說起往後兩天\n  if (t.forecast) sayH('阿檀', foreTx(t.forecast), intelTag(t.forecast) + (base ? `<br>${esc(base)}` : ''));\n  else say('', t.layers.length ? `夜里，${base}` : '夜里，镜子里的脸是干净的。');\n});\nconst onLight = () => run(async () => {\n  lightLamp(S);\n  updateTable();\n  if (glOK) focus('home', 'home');\n  say('', S.scars >= R.seatScar ? '你一个人把灯点上了。' : '她把火递给你。你们一起把灯点上了。');\n  await wait(2600);\n  await ink(() => { view = 'night'; placeScene(); say('', ''); });\n  say('', '外面的戏开锣了。你没有去。');\n});\n// v1.6：更夫報更頁的夜景剪紙（遠山城牆、屋脊戲樓、近處屋簷燈籠、月亮），字在中間的空白裡\nconst nightHTML = () => (document.documentElement.classList.contains('a-night') ? `<div class=\"nite\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img class=\"n1\" src=\"${artSrc('night/layer_1_far.png')}\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"mn\" src=\"${artSrc('night/moon.png')}\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"n2\" src=\"${artSrc('night/layer_2_roofs.png')}\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"n3\" src=\"${artSrc('night/layer_3_near.png')}\" alt=\"\"></div>` : '');\nfunction showWatch() {\n  const w = $('#watch'), l = S.T.watch || { tx: '', hint: '' }; w.hidden = false;\n  sfx('knock');\n  w.innerHTML = `${nightHTML()}<div class=\"knock\">梆　梆　梆</div><div class=\"w\">${esc(l.tx)}</div>${l.hint ? `<div class=\"w2\">${esc(l.hint)}</div>` : ''}<button class=\"opt\" data-act=\"dawn\">天亮</button>`;\n}\nconst onSleep = () => run(async () => {\n  sleep(S);\n  // 第二幕末：鏡子第一次映出底色，說清楚第三幕會怎樣\n  if (S.day === 7 && !S.left) {\n    if (glOK) { focus('mirror', 'night'); updateMirror(); }\n    say('', '');\n    sheet = { k: 'mirror' };\n    return;\n  }\n  view = 'watch';\n  showWatch();\n});\nconst onMirrorOk = () => { sheet = null; view = 'watch'; showWatch(); refresh(); };\nconst onDawn = () => run(async () => {\n  $('#watch').hidden = true;\n  dawn(S);\n  if (S.phase === 'board') { view = 'board'; sheet = { k: 'board' }; placeScene(); say('', ''); return; }\n  if (S.phase === 'lastwipe') { view = 'lastwipe'; placeScene(); say('', ''); showWipe(); return; }\n  toDay();\n});\nconst onNextAct = () => run(async () => {\n  nextAct(S);\n  // 沒過考核：摘牌，回家最後一次卸妝\n  if (S.phase === 'lastwipe') { sheet = null; await ink(() => { view = 'lastwipe'; placeScene(); say('', ''); }); showWipe(); return; }\n  toDay();\n});\n// ── 最後一次卸妝：她在，就是她替你擦；她走了、座位空了、你沒回家，就是你一個人對著鏡子 ──\nconst lastAlone = () => !!S.left || seatEmpty(S) || S.choice === 'stage' || wifeOf(S) === 2;\nfunction lastIntro(alone) {\n  if (S.left) return '门开着，屋里只有你。你对着镜子，卸今天的妆。';\n  if (S.fired) return alone ? '牌子摘下来了。你对着镜子，卸最后一次妆。' : '牌子摘下来了。这是最后一次卸妆。她拧了一条热毛巾：“我来。”';\n  if (alone && S.choice === 'stage' && !seatEmpty(S) && wifeOf(S) !== 2) return '散了戏回到家，灯是她一个人点的，她已经睡了。你对着镜子，自己卸。';\n  if (alone) return '对面的椅子空着。你对着镜子，自己卸。';\n  return '元宵过了。她拧了一条热毛巾：“最后一回，我替你卸干净。”';\n}\nfunction lastAfter(alone) {\n  const f = FAM[topFams()[0]].n, b = S.base;\n  if (!b) return alone ? '擦干净了。镜子里，是你自己的脸。' : '擦干净了。毛巾上全是红，你脸上什么也没留下。她把这块毛巾叠好，放进木匣，最上面。';\n  if (b < 4) return alone ? `擦到最后，镜子里还有一层淡淡的「${f}」色，擦不掉了。屋里没有人跟你说一句“就这样吧”。` : `擦到最后，还有一层淡淡的「${f}」色，擦不掉了。她停下手：“就这样吧，也是你。”`;\n  return alone ? `擦了很久，镜子里那张脸还是戏里的「${f}」。你分不清，哪一层是自己。` : `毛巾换了三条，那层「${f}」的颜色还在。她看了你很久，把毛巾放下了。`;\n}\nfunction showWipe() {\n  const el = $('#wipe'), alone = lastAlone(), fams = topFams().filter(f => S.played[f] > 0);\n  const use = fams.length ? fams.slice(0, 3) : ['sing'];\n  el.hidden = false; el.dataset.done = '';\n  el.innerHTML = `<div class=\"tx\">${esc(lastIntro(alone))}</div><div class=\"face\"><canvas id=\"clean\" width=\"400\" height=\"500\"></canvas><canvas id=\"paint\" width=\"400\" height=\"500\" aria-label=\"脸上的油彩，拖动来卸掉\"></canvas></div>\n    <div class=\"tx2\">${alone ? '在脸上拖动，把油彩擦掉。' : '在脸上拖动：让她一层一层替你擦掉。'}</div><button class=\"opt\" data-act=\"wipekey\">${alone ? '擦一下' : '让她擦一下'}<small>也可以直接在脸上拖</small></button>`;\n  drawPortrait($('#clean'), { who: 'you', layers: [], base: S.base, baseF: topFams()[0], bg: ['#8d9396', '#3b4044'] });\n  const cv = $('#paint'), x = cv.getContext('2d');\n  drawPortrait(cv, { who: 'you', layers: Array.from({ length: 6 }, (_, i) => ({ f: use[i % use.length] })), base: S.base, baseF: topFams()[0] });\n  x.globalCompositeOperation = 'destination-in'; x.beginPath(); x.ellipse(200, 275, 110, 141, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2); x.fill();\n  x.globalCompositeOperation = 'destination-out';\n  let down = false, last = null;\n  const brush = (a, b) => { x.lineCap = 'round'; x.lineWidth = 62; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(a[0], a[1]); x.lineTo(b[0], b[1]); x.stroke(); };\n  const at = e => { const r = cv.getBoundingClientRect(); return [(e.clientX - r.left) * cv.width / r.width, (e.clientY - r.top) * cv.height / r.height]; };\n  cv.addEventListener('pointerdown', e => { down = true; last = at(e); cv.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId); brush(last, last); });\n  cv.addEventListener('pointermove', e => { if (!down) return; const p = at(e); brush(last, p); last = p; });\n  const up = () => { if (down) { down = false; sfx('cloth'); checkWipe(); } };\n  cv.addEventListener('pointerup', up); cv.addEventListener('pointercancel', up);\n  window.__wipeKey = () => { const r = rng(hash(String(Date.now()))); for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) { const a = [110 + r() * 180, 150 + r() * 250]; brush(a, [a[0] + 90 - r() * 180, a[1] + 50 - r() * 100]); } sfx('cloth'); checkWipe(); };\n}\nfunction checkWipe() {\n  const cv = $('#paint'); if (!cv) return;\n  const d = cv.getContext('2d').getImageData(0, 0, cv.width, cv.height).data;\n  let left = 0, all = 0;\n  for (let y = 134; y < 416; y += 6) for (let X = 90; X < 310; X += 6) {\n    if (((X - 200) / 110) ** 2 + ((y - 275) / 141) ** 2 > 1) continue;\n    all += 1;\n    if (d[(y * cv.width + X) * 4 + 3] > 40) left += 1;\n  }\n  if (left / all < 0.28) showAfter();\n}\n// 擦完了：油彩散掉，剩下的是底色；說一句這張臉現在是什麼樣子\nfunction showAfter() {\n  const el = $('#wipe'), cv = $('#paint');\n  if (!cv || el.dataset.done) return;\n  el.dataset.done = '1';\n  const alone = lastAlone();\n  cv.style.transition = 'opacity 1.4s'; cv.style.opacity = '0'; cv.style.pointerEvents = 'none';\n  el.querySelector('.tx2')?.remove(); el.querySelector('[data-act=\"wipekey\"]')?.remove();\n  el.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend', `<div class=\"after\">${esc(lastAfter(alone))}</div><div class=\"tx2\">${S.base ? `底色 ${S.base}：这一季没卸掉的油彩，渗进去的，就留下了。` : '这一季的油彩，每一层都卸掉了。'}</div><button class=\"opt\" data-act=\"lastdone\">${alone ? '放下毛巾' : '让她把毛巾收起来'}</button>`);\n  el.querySelector('[data-act=\"lastdone\"]')?.focus({ preventScroll: true });\n}\nconst finishLast = () => run(async () => {\n  if (S.phase !== 'lastwipe') return;\n  // 她替你擦的最後一塊布，疊在木匣最上面\n  if (!lastAlone()) S.chest.push({ day: S.day, f: topFams()[0], last: true });\n  finishWipe(S);\n  $('#wipe').hidden = true; $('#wipe').innerHTML = '';\n  view = 'reveal'; sheet = { k: 'r_board' };\n  S.T.layers = [];\n  placeScene();\n  say('', '');\n});\n// 提前結束的結局：她走的那天、摘牌那天\nconst ENDING_EARLY = {\n  头牌: '她走的那天，水牌最上面写的是你。你回到家，门开着，那盏灯没糊完，灯上全是划痕。',\n  戏散: '她走了。你的名字还挂在水牌中间，没人来问。后面的戏，你没有再上。',\n  更夫: '她走了，牌子也摘了。春天，城里多了一个不上妆的更夫。你接过梆子，第一声敲在自家门口。',\n  卸尽: '考核那天，你的牌子被摘了下来。回到家，她什么也没问，把灯递到你手里。往后，你不用再上妆了。',\n  素脸: '摘牌那天，你素着脸回家。她没说什么，给你盛了饭。灯上熄过的几处，还暗着。',\n};\nfunction showFinal() {\n  const e = endingOf(S), w = $('#watch'), kind = ['美满', '守住', '破裂'][wifeOf(S)];\n  sheet = null; w.hidden = false; sfx('knock');\n  const early = !!(S.left || S.fired), tx = early && ENDING_EARLY[e] ? ENDING_EARLY[e] : ENDING_TX[e];\n  w.innerHTML = `${nightHTML()}<div class=\"knock\">梆　梆　梆</div><div class=\"w\">${esc(S.name)}。</div><div class=\"w2\" style=\"max-width:32em\">${esc(tx)}</div><div class=\"end ${e.length > 2 ? 'l3' : ''}\">${e}</div>\n    <div class=\"sum\">${early ? `这一季在第 ${endDay(S)} 天${S.left ? '她走了' : '摘了牌'}，提前结束 · ` : ''}卖座 ${S.gold} · 水牌第 ${rankOf(S)} · 妻子${kind} · 灯 ${S.lamp}（熄过 ${S.outs} 回）· 痕 ${S.scars} · 底色 ${S.base} · 满足 ${S.log.filter(x => x.met).length} 晚${S.choice ? ` · 元宵${{ stage: '上台', lamp: '回家点灯', cover: '替小凤代演' }[S.choice]}` : ''}</div>\n    <div class=\"acts\"><button class=\"btn go\" data-act=\"again\">再来一季</button><button class=\"btn\" data-act=\"home\">回到开场</button></div>`;\n}\n\n$('#title').addEventListener('input', e => { if (e.target.id === 'nm') draftName = e.target.value; });\ndocument.addEventListener('click', e => {\n  wakeAudio();\n  const b = e.target.closest('[data-act]');\n  if (!b || b.disabled) return;\n  const a = b.dataset.act, arg = b.dataset.arg, id = Number(arg);\n  switch (a) {\n    case 'start': setTutPref(!!$('#tutChk')?.checked); startGame((draftName.trim() || '小满').slice(0, 6)); return;\n    case 'cont': continueGame(); return;\n    case 'coachnext': coachNext(); break;\n    case 'coachskip': coachSkip(); break;\n    case 'rules': panel = panel === 'rules' ? null : 'rules'; break;\n    case 'close': panel = null; break;\n    case 'opt': S.opt[arg] = !S.opt[arg]; break;\n    case 'mute': muted = !muted; break;\n    case 'music': musicOn = !musicOn; try { localStorage.setItem(MUSIC_KEY, musicOn ? '1' : '0'); } catch (err) { /* 存不了就算了 */ } break;\n    case 'book': panel = panel === 'book' ? null : 'book'; bookSel = null; break;\n    case 'booktab': bookTab = arg; bookSel = null; break;\n    case 'booksel': bookSel = arg || null; break;\n    case 'yuan': choose(S, arg); say('', { stage: '你把戏服抖开。', lamp: '你把戏服叠起来，放回箱子。', cover: '你接过小凤托人送来的头面。' }[arg]); break;\n    case 'pick': { const c = S.deck.find(x => x.t === arg && !S.T.box.includes(x.id)); if (c) { if (S.T.box.length >= S.T.cap) S.T.box.pop(); toggleBox(S, c.id); } break; }\n    case 'yesterday': boxYesterday(S); break;\n    case 'shop': panel = 'shop'; break;\n    case 'water': panel = panel === 'water' ? null : 'water'; break;\n    case 'buy': { const c = buy(S, arg); if (c) { sfx('cheer'); if (c.relic) say('孙师父', `“${RELICS[arg].n}，你留着。”`, `卖座 −${RELICS[arg].price}，水牌第 ${rankOf(S)}：${RELICS[arg].tx}`); else say('孙师父', `“「${T[arg].n}」，拿去。”`, `卖座 −${T[arg].price}，水牌第 ${rankOf(S)}；这张进了卡组`); } break; }\n    case 'clear': clearBox(S); break;\n    case 'depart': onDepart(); return;\n    case 'endstage': onEndStage(); return;\n    case 'todoor': onToDoor(); return;\n    case 'wipe': onWipe(); return;\n    case 'enter': onEnter(); return;\n    case 'look': lookOpen = !lookOpen; break;\n    case 'endeve': onEndEvening(); return;\n    case 'light': onLight(); return;\n    case 'sleep': onSleep(); return;\n    case 'dawn': onDawn(); return;\n    case 'nextact': onNextAct(); return;\n    case 'wipekey': window.__wipeKey?.(); return;\n    case 'lastdone': finishLast(); return;\n    case 'mirrorok': onMirrorOk(); return;\n    case 'rstep': sheet = { k: arg }; if (arg === 'r_home') { focus('home', 'home'); } if (arg === 'r_chest') focus('table', 'home'); break;\n    case 'rfinal': showFinal(); break;\n    case 'again': $('#watch').hidden = true; startGame(S.name); return;\n    case 'home': $('#watch').hidden = true; saved = load(); S = null; view = 'title'; sheet = null; panel = null; coach.lesson = null; clearBubs(); if (glOK) focus('table', 'night'); refresh(); return;\n    case 'card':\n      if (view === 'morning') { toggleBox(S, id); break; }\n      if (view === 'stage') { onStage(id); return; }\n      if (view === 'evening') { onHome(id); return; }\n      if (view === 'door' || view === 'night') { onClean(id); return; }\n      break;\n  }\n  refresh();\n});\ndocument.addEventListener('keydown', e => { if (e.key === 'Escape' && panel) { panel = null; refresh(); } });\n\n// 測試用：在主控台裡看規則與流程\nwindow.__dise = { R, T, newGame, endingOf, boardOf, get S() { return S; }, get view() { return view; } };\n\n(async function boot() {\n  const glyphs = Object.values(T).map(t => t.n).join('') + Object.values(HOME).map(h => h.n + h.look).join('') + '底色戏城金接背面空白借灯唱念做打起手第天';\n  // v1.6：圖和字體一起載；圖要在搭 3D 桌子之前到齊（觀眾、牌背、裝飾都要用）\n  const artP = artLoad();\n  try { await Promise.race([Promise.all([document.fonts.load('40px \"Ma Shan Zheng\"', glyphs), document.fonts.load('16px \"Noto Serif SC\"', glyphs)]), wait(3500)]); } catch (e) { /* 字體載不到就用後備字體 */ }\n  await artP;\n  artSetup();\n  initGL();\n  saved = load();\n  if (glOK) {\n    focus('table', 'night');\n    wife.base = 'work'; wife.pose('work'); wife.root.position.set(0, -0.32, SEAT_Z[0]); stool.position.set(0, 0, SEAT_Z[0] - 0.02);\n    actor.root.visible = false;\n    drawPortrait(mirrorCv, { who: 'you', layers: [], bg: ['#8d9396', '#3b4044'] }); mirrorTex.needsUpdate = true;\n  }\n  refresh();\n})();\n</script>\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":3459,"oldLines":7,"newStart":3459,"newLines":35,"lines":["   // 裝匣的兩個按鈕跟著妝匣","   const tools = view === 'morning' && !lockedBox(S) ? `<button class=\"mini\" data-act=\"yesterday\" ${S.lastBox ? '' : 'disabled'}>照昨天装</button><button class=\"mini\" data-act=\"clear\" ${t.box.length ? '' : 'disabled'}>全拿出来</button>` : '';","   lb.innerHTML = `${tx ? `<span class=\"hlb\">${esc(tx)}</span>` : ''}${tools}`;","+  fitHand();"," }","+// v1.6 修：手牌一定整排擺進畫面。","+// v1.5 的 .hand 置中又可橫捲：牌一多（妝匣 10 張，加妝奩 11 張）、畫面一窄（手機、平板直放、不到約 980 寬的視窗），","+// 整排往兩邊溢出——右邊溢出的要捲才看得到（捲軸藏起來了），左邊溢出的根本捲不到，看起來就像少了一兩張。","+// 現在：放得下照原樣；放不下先把牌疊緊（每張至少露六成），還不夠再一起縮小（最小到 75%），再不夠才繼續疊；","+// 窄到每張露不到三成才改成從最左一張排起、可以橫捲。扇形角度、高低、能打不能打、「家」都照 renderHand，這裡只管寬高與間距。","+function fitHand() {","+  const h = $('#hand'), cards = h.querySelectorAll('.hc'), n = cards.length;","+  h.classList.remove('fit', 'scroll');","+  if (n < 2) return;","+  const cs = getComputedStyle(cards[0]);","+  const w0 = parseFloat(cs.width), h0 = parseFloat(cs.height), step0 = w0 + parseFloat(cs.marginLeft) + parseFloat(cs.marginRight);","+  const avail = h.clientWidth - 4;","+  // 最外那張轉了幾度（跟 renderHand 同一條式子）；轉軸在牌下方（120%），外側的上角會甩出牌邊 out 像素","+  const a = (n - 1) / 2 * Math.min(2.6, 24 / n) * Math.PI / 180;","+  const out = s => s * Math.max(0, 1.2 * h0 * Math.sin(a) - w0 / 2 * (1 - Math.cos(a)));","+  const room = s => avail - w0 * s - 2 * out(s); // 第一張以外，n−1 個間距一共能用多少","+  if (room(1) >= (n - 1) * step0) return;","+  const F = 0.62, SMIN = 0.75, FMIN = 0.3;","+  const s = clamp(avail / (w0 * (1 + (n - 1) * F) + 2 * out(1)), SMIN, 1);","+  let step = room(s) / (n - 1);","+  if (step < FMIN * w0 * s) { step = FMIN * w0 * s; h.classList.add('scroll'); }","+  h.classList.add('fit');","+  h.style.setProperty('--hw', `${(w0 * s).toFixed(2)}px`);","+  h.style.setProperty('--hh', `${(h0 * s).toFixed(2)}px`);","+  h.style.setProperty('--hm', `${((step - w0 * s) / 2).toFixed(2)}px`);","+  h.style.setProperty('--hv', `${step.toFixed(2)}px`);","+}"," // 第一人稱時，臉上沒卸的台上臉化成螢幕四邊的油彩"," function renderSmear() {","   const cv = $('#smear'), w = innerWidth, h = innerHeight;"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_017qFdZ77RbQwrdHK9uhBjf4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
