{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgyb1CWKKa2SvvtYsGyWV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011hCt6MzrTA9uBBnXSVxGRe","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git -c user.name=Claude -c user.email=noreply@anthropic.com commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\n新增 v1.6 美術接入：接上 Codex V2 的 162 張圖、可雙擊的單檔版，修手牌少一兩張\n\n- 原型/assets/：正式美術庫 162 張（cards 69、crowd 40、deco 12、relics 14、ui 12、fx 5、night 4、draft 6），原樣複製自 Codex 生圖，manifest.json 記 SHA-256 與用途\n- 原型/v1.6/：卡面插圖 31 組、紙紋、邊框、牌背；剪紙觀眾 40 張；守旧背幕、台毯、窗花、臉譜、燈紙、木匣蓋；後台物件 7 組；紙面板、筆劃、印、燈芯、墨痕、她的樣子；連擊與倒彩特效；更夫報更與結局頁的夜景；同門與孫師父頭像。載不到圖退回 v1.5 畫法；阿檀、台上的你、鏡中臉沿用 v1.5。規則數值同 v1.5\n- 修手牌：一排放不下時疊緊、縮小，整排擺進畫面（手機、平板、窄視窗、橫放都不再有牌切在外面或捲不到），牌底不再被切；扇形、能打不能打、「家」不變\n- index.packed.html：圖內嵌、可直接雙擊；由 pack.js 產生\n- 設計/v1.6_戲城_美術接入.md、設計/美術/V16_PROGRESS.md、V16_RESULT.md；README 加上 v1.6 與兩種打開方式\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log -1 --format='%h %an <%ae>%n%s' && git status -sb | head -1 && git show --stat HEAD | tail -4","description":"Commit the v1.6 deliverables locally"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":665,"cache_read_input_tokens":408883,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":665},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b8aac215-a6d7-40a1-80d9-8070eb8060bf","uuid":"7d7ffbd9-728a-4424-afe6-d60161e5f876","timestamp":"2026-11-12T19:29:13.352Z","request_id":"req_011Cgyb1CBxmRBazLMGxySrY","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_011hCt6MzrTA9uBBnXSVxGRe":{"command":"cd /Users/tsun/Projects/game-dise && git -c user.name=Claude -c user.email=noreply@anthropic.com commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\n新增 v1.6 美術接入：接上 Codex V2 的 162 張圖、可雙擊的單檔版，修手牌少一兩張\n\n- 原型/assets/：正式美術庫 162 張（c